      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The principal objects of this Part are:\n\n(a) to ensure that Australian exporters have continued access to\noutwards liner cargo shipping services of adequate frequency\nand reliability at freight rates that are internationally\ncompetitive;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107-ss-1-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Justify the obligation based on the objects.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The principal objects of this Part are:\n\n(a) to ensure that Australian exporters have continued access to\noutwards liner cargo shipping services of adequate frequency\nand reliability at freight rates that are internationally\ncompetitive;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Promote stable export markets.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The principal objects of this Part are:\n\n(b) to promote conditions in the international liner cargo shipping industry that encourage stable access to export markets for exporters in all States and Territories;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(2) 01  Objects of Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-107-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "(2) It is the intention of the Parliament that the principal objects of this\nPart should be achieved:\n\n(a) by permitting continued conference operations while\nenhancing the competitive environment for international liner\ncargo shipping services through the provision of adequate\nand appropriate safeguards against abuse of conference\npower, particularly by:\n\n(i) enacting additional restrictive trade practice provisions\napplying to ocean carriers;\n\n(ii) requiring conference agreements to meet certain\nminimum standards;\n\n(iii) making conference agreements generally publicly\navailable;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(2) It is the intention of the Parliament that the principal objects of this\nPart should be achieved:\n\n(a) by permitting continued conference operations while\nenhancing the competitive environment for international liner\ncargo shipping services through the provision of adequate\nand appropriate safeguards against abuse of conference\npower, particularly by:\n\n(i) enacting additional restrictive trade practice provisions\napplying to ocean carriers;\n\n(ii) requiring conference agreements to meet certain\nminimum standards;\n\n(iii) making conference agreements generally publicly\navailable;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f11ab1a09ebf5656714ce709a2f43cbcbd7a32b39e8cee381ef9d08e8a4ded4",
      "skos:note": "Ensure conference agreements meet minimum standards."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-107-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(2) 01  Objects of Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "(2) It is the intention of the Parliament that the principal objects of this\nPart should be achieved:\n\n(a) by permitting continued conference operations while\nenhancing the competitive environment for international liner\ncargo shipping services through the provision of adequate\nand appropriate safeguards against abuse of conference\npower, particularly by:\n\n(i) enacting additional restrictive trade practice provisions\napplying to ocean carriers;\n\n(ii) requiring conference agreements to meet certain\nminimum standards;\n\n(iii) making conference agreements generally publicly\navailable;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-107-ss-2-norm",
