    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-110-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(3) 02A  Inland terminals",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-110-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.41",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In making a declaration under subsection (1), the Minister must\nhave regard to the following matters:\n\n(a) whether the facility is under the control of a person who is, or\nof persons each of whom is:\n\n(i) an ocean carrier; or\n\n(ii) a person who provides services at the facility at the\nrequest of an ocean carrier;\n\n(b) whether the facility is used for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n\n(i) assembling export cargoes for transport to a port\nterminal located at the port where the cargoes are to be\nloaded onto ships for export;\n\n(ii) delivering imported cargoes to importers or their\nrepresentatives;\n\n(c) any other matters that the Minister thinks are relevant.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In making a declaration under subsection (1), the Minister must\nhave regard to the following matters:\n\n(a) whether the facility is under the control of a person who is, or\nof persons each of whom is:\n\n(i) an ocean carrier; or\n\n(ii) a person who provides services at the facility at the\nrequest of an ocean carrier;\n\n(b) whether the facility is used for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n\n(i) assembling export cargoes for transport to a port\nterminal located at the port where the cargoes are to be\nloaded onto ships for export;\n\n(ii) delivering imported cargoes to importers or their\nrepresentatives;\n\n(c) any other matters that the Minister thinks are relevant.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-110"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-110-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-110-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a479e27d09e088d6015b8e8b932b24b631e54d0bf80b34d72b95b1bc91a2b259",
      "skos:note": "Minister must consider certain matters when making a declaration under subsection (1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-110-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(3) 02A  Inland terminals",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 41,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In making a declaration under subsection (1), the Minister must\nhave regard to the following matters:\n\n(a) whether the facility is under the control of a person who is, or\nof persons each of whom is:\n\n(i) an ocean carrier; or\n\n(ii) a person who provides services at the facility at the\nrequest of an ocean carrier;\n\n(b) whether the facility is used for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n\n(i) assembling export cargoes for transport to a port\nterminal located at the port where the cargoes are to be\nloaded onto ships for export;\n\n(ii) delivering imported cargoes to importers or their\nrepresentatives;\n\n(c) any other matters that the Minister thinks are relevant.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
