      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The particulars entered in the register shall include whether the\nassociation is a designated outwards peak shipper body, a\ndesignated inwards peak shipper body, a designated outwards\nsecondary shipper body or a designated inwards secondary shipper\nbody.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The particulars entered in the register shall include whether the\nassociation is a designated outwards peak shipper body, a\ndesignated inwards peak shipper body, a designated outwards\nsecondary shipper body or a designated inwards secondary shipper\nbody.",
      "values:partOf": {
