      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make guidelines to be\napplied by the Registrar in the exercise of the Registrar’s powers to\nnominate designated secondary shipper bodies for the purposes of\nsections 10.29, 10.41 and 10.52.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make guidelines to be\napplied by the Registrar in the exercise of the Registrar’s powers to\nnominate designated secondary shipper bodies for the purposes of\nsections 10.29, 10.41 and 10.52.",
      "values:partOf": {
