    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-116",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 09  Where may consequences of conference agreements not",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-116"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "complying with minimum standards be found?\n\nThe consequences of a conference agreement not complying with\nthis Division are to be found in the following provisions:\n\n(a) section 10.28 (decision on application for provisional\nregistration);\n\n(b) section 10.33 (decision on application for final registration);\n\n(c) section 10.45 (circumstances in which Minister may exercise\npowers in relation to registered conference agreements).\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "complying with minimum standards be found?\n\nThe consequences of a conference agreement not complying with\nthis Division are to be found in the following provisions:\n\n(a) section 10.28 (decision on application for provisional\nregistration);\n\n(b) section 10.33 (decision on application for final registration);\n\n(c) section 10.45 (circumstances in which Minister may exercise\npowers in relation to registered conference agreements).\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-116-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "976d17621e8da3175057b5fc832d87518d29e907d2d051ea4011b369c6a7c4a8",
      "skos:note": "References other provisions for consequences of non-compliance with minimum standards."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-116",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 09  Where may consequences of conference agreements not",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 47,
      "values:originalText": "complying with minimum standards be found?\n\nThe consequences of a conference agreement not complying with\nthis Division are to be found in the following provisions:\n\n(a) section 10.28 (decision on application for provisional\nregistration);\n\n(b) section 10.33 (decision on application for final registration);\n\n(c) section 10.45 (circumstances in which Minister may exercise\npowers in relation to registered conference agreements).\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
