    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-118",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 11  What registers are to be kept by the Registrar?",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-118"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Registrar shall keep:\n\n(a) a register of conference agreements; and\n\n(b) a register of designated shipper bodies; and\n\n(c) a register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial\nmarket power; and\n\n(d) a register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices;\nand\n\n(e) a register of ocean carrier agents; and\n\n(f) a register of exemption orders.\n\n(2) An entry in a register must contain such particulars as are\nprescribed in relation to the register.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Registrar shall keep:\n\n(a) a register of conference agreements; and\n\n(b) a register of designated shipper bodies; and\n\n(c) a register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial\nmarket power; and\n\n(d) a register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices;\nand\n\n(e) a register of ocean carrier agents; and\n\n(f) a register of exemption orders.\n\n(2) An entry in a register must contain such particulars as are\nprescribed in relation to the register.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-118-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-118-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a90488a23eaaee736b21bdfa369fe7aeaee21a7932a45ce2dcf8f28c3b0fff03"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-118",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 11  What registers are to be kept by the Registrar?",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Registrar shall keep:\n\n(a) a register of conference agreements; and\n\n(b) a register of designated shipper bodies; and\n\n(c) a register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial\nmarket power; and\n\n(d) a register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices;\nand\n\n(e) a register of ocean carrier agents; and\n\n(f) a register of exemption orders.\n\n(2) An entry in a register must contain such particulars as are\nprescribed in relation to the register."
    },
