    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-120",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 13  What register is to be kept by the Commission?",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-120"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission shall keep a register of Commission\ninvestigations.\n\n(2) Subject to section 10.88, the register of Commission investigations\nshall contain:\n\n(a) references given to the Commission by the Minister under\nsubsections 10.47(1), 10.50(1), 10.57(1) and 10.63(1);\n\n(b) particulars of decisions made by the Commission under\nsubsections 10.48(2), 10.48(2A) and 10.58(2) to hold\ninvestigations;\n\n(c) requests made to the Commission by the Minister under\nsubsections 10.48(3) and 10.58(3);\n\n(d) documents given to the Commission in relation to\ninvestigations by it under this Part;\n\n(e) particulars of oral submissions made to the Commission in\nrelation to such investigations; and\n\n(f) reports given to the Minister by the Commission in relation\nto such investigations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission shall keep a register of Commission\ninvestigations.\n\n(2) Subject to section 10.88, the register of Commission investigations\nshall contain:\n\n(a) references given to the Commission by the Minister under\nsubsections 10.47(1), 10.50(1), 10.57(1) and 10.63(1);\n\n(b) particulars of decisions made by the Commission under\nsubsections 10.48(2), 10.48(2A) and 10.58(2) to hold\ninvestigations;\n\n(c) requests made to the Commission by the Minister under\nsubsections 10.48(3) and 10.58(3);\n\n(d) documents given to the Commission in relation to\ninvestigations by it under this Part;\n\n(e) particulars of oral submissions made to the Commission in\nrelation to such investigations; and\n\n(f) reports given to the Minister by the Commission in relation\nto such investigations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-120-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-120-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d796ad234e2ca67c866e27e7b7f47e83c7f63ffad0c32d826fbfb0c2b1ce94f2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-120",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 13  What register is to be kept by the Commission?",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission shall keep a register of Commission\ninvestigations.\n\n(2) Subject to section 10.88, the register of Commission investigations\nshall contain:\n\n(a) references given to the Commission by the Minister under\nsubsections 10.47(1), 10.50(1), 10.57(1) and 10.63(1);\n\n(b) particulars of decisions made by the Commission under\nsubsections 10.48(2), 10.48(2A) and 10.58(2) to hold\ninvestigations;\n\n(c) requests made to the Commission by the Minister under\nsubsections 10.48(3) and 10.58(3);\n\n(d) documents given to the Commission in relation to\ninvestigations by it under this Part;\n\n(e) particulars of oral submissions made to the Commission in\nrelation to such investigations; and\n\n(f) reports given to the Minister by the Commission in relation\nto such investigations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
