      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-121-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(4) 14  Exemptions apply only to certain activities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(4) To avoid doubt, the exemptions provided by this Subdivision do\nnot extend to any dealings between the parties to a conference\nagreement and a person who provides ancillary services on behalf\nof the provider of a scheduled cargo shipping service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-121-ss-4-norm",
