      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-123",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 16  Exemptions do not apply to variations of conference",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-123"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "agreement unless varying agreement registered\n\nWhere a registered conference agreement is varied or otherwise\naffected by a varying conference agreement (other than an\nagreement that consists solely of freight rate charges), the\nexemptions provided by this Subdivision (other than\nsections 10.17A and 10.18A) apply only in relation to the operation\nof the registered conference agreement itself, and not that\nagreement as varied or otherwise affected, unless the varying\nconference agreement has been finally registered.",
      "skos:definition": "agreement unless varying agreement registered\n\nWhere a registered conference agreement is varied or otherwise\naffected by a varying conference agreement (other than an\nagreement that consists solely of freight rate charges), the\nexemptions provided by this Subdivision (other than\nsections 10.17A and 10.18A) apply only in relation to the operation\nof the registered conference agreement itself, and not that\nagreement as varied or otherwise affected, unless the varying\nconference agreement has been finally registered.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-123-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-123-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cc52c7dd67a67b2ec3d3b2dbc29c10e2afb7facd6e8bff4e440ba951d28a419f",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions apply only to operation of registered conference agreement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-123",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 16  Exemptions do not apply to variations of conference",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "agreement unless varying agreement registered\n\nWhere a registered conference agreement is varied or otherwise\naffected by a varying conference agreement (other than an\nagreement that consists solely of freight rate charges), the\nexemptions provided by this Subdivision (other than\nsections 10.17A and 10.18A) apply only in relation to the operation\nof the registered conference agreement itself, and not that\nagreement as varied or otherwise affected, unless the varying\nconference agreement has been finally registered."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-123-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-123"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-123-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "only if",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional exemption",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-124",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 17  Exemptions from sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK and 45",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-124"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ and 45 do not apply in relation to the making\nof a contract or arrangement, or the arriving at an understanding, if:\n\n(a) the contract, arrangement or understanding is a conference\nagreement; and\n\n(b) the parties apply for its provisional registration under this\nPart within 30 days after the making of the contract or\narrangement or arriving at the understanding.\n\n(2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct\nengaged in by a party to a registered conference agreement so far\nas the conduct gives effect to a provision of the agreement in\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ and 45 do not apply in relation to the making\nof a contract or arrangement, or the arriving at an understanding, if:\n\n(a) the contract, arrangement or understanding is a conference\nagreement; and\n\n(b) the parties apply for its provisional registration under this\nPart within 30 days after the making of the contract or\narrangement or arriving at the understanding.\n\n(2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct\nengaged in by a party to a registered conference agreement so far\nas the conduct gives effect to a provision of the agreement in\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-124-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-124-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "49f5ae1dd097f536c0a63cebcf434b2af2ec94037e0f3d852292eb2a199cc092"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-124",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 17  Exemptions from sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK and 45",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ and 45 do not apply in relation to the making\nof a contract or arrangement, or the arriving at an understanding, if:\n\n(a) the contract, arrangement or understanding is a conference\nagreement; and\n\n(b) the parties apply for its provisional registration under this\nPart within 30 days after the making of the contract or\narrangement or arriving at the understanding.\n\n(2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct\nengaged in by a party to a registered conference agreement so far\nas the conduct gives effect to a provision of the agreement in\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-124-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(1) 17  Exemptions from sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK and 45",
