      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct\nengaged in by a party to a registered conference agreement so far\nas the conduct gives effect to a provision of the agreement in\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct\nengaged in by a party to a registered conference agreement so far\nas the conduct gives effect to a provision of the agreement in\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
