      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 47 does not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by a\nparty to a registered conference agreement so far as the conduct\ngives effect to a provision of the agreement in relation to an\noutwards liner cargo shipping service or an inwards liner cargo\nshipping service.\n\n(2) The exemption provided by subsection (1) does not apply in\nrelation to subsections 47(6) and (7).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Section 47 does not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by a\nparty to a registered conference agreement so far as the conduct\ngives effect to a provision of the agreement in relation to an\noutwards liner cargo shipping service or an inwards liner cargo\nshipping service.\n\n(2) The exemption provided by subsection (1) does not apply in\nrelation to subsections 47(6) and (7).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-126-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-126-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "37f786580492abe8a5fff48085c6335e37605a7ba85b5f04dd795347b262a409"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-126",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 18  Exemption from section 47",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 47 does not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by a\nparty to a registered conference agreement so far as the conduct\ngives effect to a provision of the agreement in relation to an\noutwards liner cargo shipping service or an inwards liner cargo\nshipping service.\n\n(2) The exemption provided by subsection (1) does not apply in\nrelation to subsections 47(6) and (7)."
    },
