    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-130",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 21  Exemptions cease to apply in relation to a shipper at the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-130"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "shipper’s option\n\nThe exemptions provided by this Subdivision in relation to the\noperation of a loyalty agreement cease to apply in relation to\nconduct engaged in by an ocean carrier in relation to a shipper if\nthe shipper notifies, as prescribed, the Commission and each ocean\ncarrier who is a party to the agreement that the shipper no longer\nwishes the exemptions to apply.\nSubdivision D—Other exemptions",
      "skos:definition": "shipper’s option\n\nThe exemptions provided by this Subdivision in relation to the\noperation of a loyalty agreement cease to apply in relation to\nconduct engaged in by an ocean carrier in relation to a shipper if\nthe shipper notifies, as prescribed, the Commission and each ocean\ncarrier who is a party to the agreement that the shipper no longer\nwishes the exemptions to apply.\nSubdivision D—Other exemptions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-130-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-130-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "be507d46f0522b5e5369824fde107dae48ef512b113dbe61ddfdd60ca0419c2a",
      "skos:note": "Shipper can notify Commission and carriers to cease exemptions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-130",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 21  Exemptions cease to apply in relation to a shipper at the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "shipper’s option\n\nThe exemptions provided by this Subdivision in relation to the\noperation of a loyalty agreement cease to apply in relation to\nconduct engaged in by an ocean carrier in relation to a shipper if\nthe shipper notifies, as prescribed, the Commission and each ocean\ncarrier who is a party to the agreement that the shipper no longer\nwishes the exemptions to apply.\nSubdivision D—Other exemptions"
    },
