    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-136",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 27A  Copy of conference agreement to be given to designated peak",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-136"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "shipper body\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) the parties to an outwards conference agreement apply for its\nprovisional registration; and\n\n(b) at the time of the application, there is a designated outwards\npeak shipper body;\nthe parties must give the designated outwards peak shipper body a\ncopy of:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "shipper body\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) the parties to an outwards conference agreement apply for its\nprovisional registration; and\n\n(b) at the time of the application, there is a designated outwards\npeak shipper body;\nthe parties must give the designated outwards peak shipper body a\ncopy of:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
