      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The nomination of a designated secondary shipper body for the\npurposes of a provisionally registered conference agreement must\nbe made by written notice given to the parties to the agreement.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The nomination of a designated secondary shipper body for the\npurposes of a provisionally registered conference agreement must\nbe made by written notice given to the parties to the agreement.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
