    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-139",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 30  Application for final registration of conference agreement",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-139"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The parties to a provisionally registered conference agreement may\napply for its final registration under this Part.\n\n(2) The application must comply with the following provisions:\n\n(a) subsections 10.31(1) and (2) (how application is to be made\nand verified);\n\n(b) section 10.32 (copy of agreement to be filed with application\netc.).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The parties to a provisionally registered conference agreement may\napply for its final registration under this Part.\n\n(2) The application must comply with the following provisions:\n\n(a) subsections 10.31(1) and (2) (how application is to be made\nand verified);\n\n(b) section 10.32 (copy of agreement to be filed with application\netc.).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-139-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-139-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0dcf1473adf503c95af3b61b56cc733e31cf38fd28a2ad092c41bb9cd9ba4a6f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-139",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 30  Application for final registration of conference agreement",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The parties to a provisionally registered conference agreement may\napply for its final registration under this Part.\n\n(2) The application must comply with the following provisions:\n\n(a) subsections 10.31(1) and (2) (how application is to be made\nand verified);\n\n(b) section 10.32 (copy of agreement to be filed with application\netc.)."
    },
    {
