    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 Section 10",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-141"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "32  Copy of agreement to be filed with application etc.\n\n(1) Subject to subsections (1A) and (1B), an application for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement must be accompanied by:\n\n(a) a complete copy of the agreement so far as it is in writing\n(including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are\nin writing); and\n\n(b) a written memorandum that fully sets out the agreement so\nfar as it is not in writing (including all provisions of the\nagreement so far as they are not in writing).\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nRegistration of conference agreements  Division 6\n\nSection 10.33\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(1A) The copy of the agreement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) need not\ninclude the freight rate charges in the agreement.\n\n(1B) The written memorandum referred to in paragraph (1)(b) need not\ninclude the freight rate charges in the agreement.\n\n(2) A document that accompanies an application for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement must comply with any\nregulations requiring its verification (in whole or part) by or on\nbehalf of the applicants.",
      "skos:definition": "32  Copy of agreement to be filed with application etc.\n\n(1) Subject to subsections (1A) and (1B), an application for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement must be accompanied by:\n\n(a) a complete copy of the agreement so far as it is in writing\n(including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are\nin writing); and\n\n(b) a written memorandum that fully sets out the agreement so\nfar as it is not in writing (including all provisions of the\nagreement so far as they are not in writing).\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nRegistration of conference agreements  Division 6\n\nSection 10.33\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(1A) The copy of the agreement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) need not\ninclude the freight rate charges in the agreement.\n\n(1B) The written memorandum referred to in paragraph (1)(b) need not\ninclude the freight rate charges in the agreement.\n\n(2) A document that accompanies an application for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement must comply with any\nregulations requiring its verification (in whole or part) by or on\nbehalf of the applicants.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-1b"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "966b9dbd0c4efcffa548c27800222f770931b24d54c21c5a2ba1e2613695397f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-141",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Section 10",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "32  Copy of agreement to be filed with application etc.\n\n(1) Subject to subsections (1A) and (1B), an application for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement must be accompanied by:\n\n(a) a complete copy of the agreement so far as it is in writing\n(including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are\nin writing); and\n\n(b) a written memorandum that fully sets out the agreement so\nfar as it is not in writing (including all provisions of the\nagreement so far as they are not in writing).\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nRegistration of conference agreements  Division 6\n\nSection 10.33\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(1A) The copy of the agreement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) need not\ninclude the freight rate charges in the agreement.\n\n(1B) The written memorandum referred to in paragraph (1)(b) need not\ninclude the freight rate charges in the agreement.\n\n(2) A document that accompanies an application for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement must comply with any\nregulations requiring its verification (in whole or part) by or on\nbehalf of the applicants."
    },
