    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 33  Decision on application for final registration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-142"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.65",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Registrar is satisfied:\n\n(a) that an application has properly been made for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) that the agreement complies with section 10.07\n(minimum levels of shipping services to be specified in\nconference agreements) or, if the agreement varies or\notherwise affects another conference agreement, that the\nother conference agreement as varied or affected\ncomplies with section 10.07;\n\n(ii) that section 10.07 does not apply in relation to the\nagreement because of an exemption order;\n\n(iii) that the agreement is an inwards conference agreement\nthat was in force at the commencement of this\nsubparagraph; and\n\n(ba) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) that the agreement complies with section 10.08\n(conference agreements may include only certain\nrestrictive trade practice provisions) or, if the agreement\nvaries or otherwise affects another conference\nagreement, that the other conference agreement as\nvaried or affected complies with section 10.08;\n\n(ii) that section 10.08 does not apply in relation to the\nagreement because of an exemption order;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Registrar is satisfied:\n\n(a) that an application has properly been made for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) that the agreement complies with section 10.07\n(minimum levels of shipping services to be specified in\nconference agreements) or, if the agreement varies or\notherwise affects another conference agreement, that the\nother conference agreement as varied or affected\ncomplies with section 10.07;\n\n(ii) that section 10.07 does not apply in relation to the\nagreement because of an exemption order;\n\n(iii) that the agreement is an inwards conference agreement\nthat was in force at the commencement of this\nsubparagraph; and\n\n(ba) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) that the agreement complies with section 10.08\n(conference agreements may include only certain\nrestrictive trade practice provisions) or, if the agreement\nvaries or otherwise affects another conference\nagreement, that the other conference agreement as\nvaried or affected complies with section 10.08;\n\n(ii) that section 10.08 does not apply in relation to the\nagreement because of an exemption order;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8c784b13d27d8f43dc82d1e39b906791c3d9763aba56d0005c61cfc1661716b7",
      "skos:note": "The Registrar must be satisfied that an application for final registration of a conference agreement complies with certain subsections."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-142",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 33  Decision on application for final registration",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 65,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Registrar is satisfied:\n\n(a) that an application has properly been made for the final\nregistration of a conference agreement; and\n\n(b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) that the agreement complies with section 10.07\n(minimum levels of shipping services to be specified in\nconference agreements) or, if the agreement varies or\notherwise affects another conference agreement, that the\nother conference agreement as varied or affected\ncomplies with section 10.07;\n\n(ii) that section 10.07 does not apply in relation to the\nagreement because of an exemption order;\n\n(iii) that the agreement is an inwards conference agreement\nthat was in force at the commencement of this\nsubparagraph; and\n\n(ba) any of the following subparagraphs applies:\n\n(i) that the agreement complies with section 10.08\n(conference agreements may include only certain\nrestrictive trade practice provisions) or, if the agreement\nvaries or otherwise affects another conference\nagreement, that the other conference agreement as\nvaried or affected complies with section 10.08;\n\n(ii) that section 10.08 does not apply in relation to the\nagreement because of an exemption order;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-142"
