    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-144",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 35  Abstract to accompany request for confidentiality",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-144"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.67",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where a request is made under section 10.34 that a part of the\napplication in which the request is included, or of a document\naccompanying the application, not be open to public inspection\nunder this Part, the application must be accompanied by an abstract\nof the part of the application or other document in relation to which\nthe request is made.\n\n(2) The abstract must:\n\n(a) be in the appropriate prescribed form; and\n\n(b) comply with any regulations requiring its verification (in\nwhole or part) by or on behalf of the applicants.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Where a request is made under section 10.34 that a part of the\napplication in which the request is included, or of a document\naccompanying the application, not be open to public inspection\nunder this Part, the application must be accompanied by an abstract\nof the part of the application or other document in relation to which\nthe request is made.\n\n(2) The abstract must:\n\n(a) be in the appropriate prescribed form; and\n\n(b) comply with any regulations requiring its verification (in\nwhole or part) by or on behalf of the applicants.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-144-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-144-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bff1f1b548736d9026b927932bcdfda67706d505b19791a9f2a769f8a815f3df"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-144",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 35  Abstract to accompany request for confidentiality",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 67,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where a request is made under section 10.34 that a part of the\napplication in which the request is included, or of a document\naccompanying the application, not be open to public inspection\nunder this Part, the application must be accompanied by an abstract\nof the part of the application or other document in relation to which\nthe request is made.\n\n(2) The abstract must:\n\n(a) be in the appropriate prescribed form; and\n\n(b) comply with any regulations requiring its verification (in\nwhole or part) by or on behalf of the applicants."
    },
