      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.67",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where:\n\n(a) a request is properly made under section 10.34 that a part of a\ndocument not be open to public inspection under this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the request is accompanied by an abstract of the part of the\ndocument;\nthe Registrar shall first determine whether to accept the abstract.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Where:\n\n(a) a request is properly made under section 10.34 that a part of a\ndocument not be open to public inspection under this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the request is accompanied by an abstract of the part of the\ndocument;\nthe Registrar shall first determine whether to accept the abstract.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-145-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-145-logic-deontic-1"
