    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-151",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 42  Application to be made for registration of varying conference",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-151"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "agreements\n\n(1) Subject to subsection (3), where a conference agreement that varies\nor otherwise affects a registered conference agreement is made or\narrived at, application shall be made for its provisional registration.\n\n(2) The application must be made within 30 days after the making of\nor arriving at the agreement.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a conference agreement that\nconsists solely of freight rate charges.",
      "skos:definition": "agreements\n\n(1) Subject to subsection (3), where a conference agreement that varies\nor otherwise affects a registered conference agreement is made or\narrived at, application shall be made for its provisional registration.\n\n(2) The application must be made within 30 days after the making of\nor arriving at the agreement.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a conference agreement that\nconsists solely of freight rate charges.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-151-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-151-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-151-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bbf2df780dbc780dcd702a1bb88cde7d6f686789b6249d88ad67e102a6d185f6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-151",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 42  Application to be made for registration of varying conference",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 74,
      "values:originalText": "agreements\n\n(1) Subject to subsection (3), where a conference agreement that varies\nor otherwise affects a registered conference agreement is made or\narrived at, application shall be made for its provisional registration.\n\n(2) The application must be made within 30 days after the making of\nor arriving at the agreement.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a conference agreement that\nconsists solely of freight rate charges."
    },
