      "skos:note": "Registrar may make variations to conference agreement particulars upon notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-152-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(4) 43  Parties to registered conference agreement to notify",
