    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-153-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(8) 44  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to registered",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-153-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(8) If:\n\n(a) the Commission reports to the Minister under section 10.47\nor 10.48 in relation to either or both of the matters referred to\nin subparagraphs 10.45(1)(a)(viii) and (ix); and\n\n(b) after taking the report into account, the Minister is satisfied\nof either or both of those matters and decides to give a\ndirection under subsection (1);\nthe Minister must:\n\n(c) prepare a statement about the decision; and\n\n(d) cause:\n\n(i) a copy of the statement; and\n\n(ii) a copy of the Commission’s report;\n\nto be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15\nsittings days of that House after the decision was made.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If:\n\n(a) the Commission reports to the Minister under section 10.47\nor 10.48 in relation to either or both of the matters referred to\nin subparagraphs 10.45(1)(a)(viii) and (ix); and\n\n(b) after taking the report into account, the Minister is satisfied\nof either or both of those matters and decides to give a\ndirection under subsection (1);\nthe Minister must:\n\n(c) prepare a statement about the decision; and\n\n(d) cause:\n\n(i) a copy of the statement; and\n\n(ii) a copy of the Commission’s report;\n\nto be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15\nsittings days of that House after the decision was made.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-153"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-153-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-153-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8fb340b0d5bfbd349b3d16665cfc758dc7fee93ca954b485864d48bb8414ebcc",
      "skos:note": "Minister must prepare and lay before Parliament a statement about the decision within 15 sitting days.",
      "dc:description": "statement, report"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-153-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(8) 44  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to registered",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(8) If:\n\n(a) the Commission reports to the Minister under section 10.47\nor 10.48 in relation to either or both of the matters referred to\nin subparagraphs 10.45(1)(a)(viii) and (ix); and\n\n(b) after taking the report into account, the Minister is satisfied\nof either or both of those matters and decides to give a\ndirection under subsection (1);\nthe Minister must:\n\n(c) prepare a statement about the decision; and\n\n(d) cause:\n\n(i) a copy of the statement; and\n\n(ii) a copy of the Commission’s report;\n\nto be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15\nsittings days of that House after the decision was made."
    },
    {
