      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, after taking the Commission’s report into account, the Minister\nis satisfied of one or more of the matters referred to in\nparagraph 10.45(1)(a), the Minister may, within 21 days after\nreceiving the Commission’s report, direct the Registrar not to take\naction under subsection (4) in relation to the agreement, and may\nalso give such further directions under subsection 10.44(1) in\nrelation to the agreement as the Minister considers appropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, after taking the Commission’s report into account, the Minister\nis satisfied of one or more of the matters referred to in\nparagraph 10.45(1)(a), the Minister may, within 21 days after\nreceiving the Commission’s report, direct the Registrar not to take\naction under subsection (4) in relation to the agreement, and may\nalso give such further directions under subsection 10.44(1) in\nrelation to the agreement as the Minister considers appropriate.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-155"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-155-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-155-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "72d3260b2dc9c8a7687b4772456ab647b2400ba3ce60758ecb35d08e460b03b9",
      "skos:note": "Minister may direct Registrar not to take action under subsection (4) in relation to agreement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-155-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(3) 46  Action to be taken where powers exercised by Minister",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 81,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, after taking the Commission’s report into account, the Minister\nis satisfied of one or more of the matters referred to in\nparagraph 10.45(1)(a), the Minister may, within 21 days after\nreceiving the Commission’s report, direct the Registrar not to take\naction under subsection (4) in relation to the agreement, and may\nalso give such further directions under subsection 10.44(1) in\nrelation to the agreement as the Minister considers appropriate."
    },
