    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-164",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 54  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to obligations of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-164"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market\npower\n\n(1) Subject to sections 10.55 and 10.56, the Minister may, by writing\nserved on a registered non-conference ocean carrier with\nsubstantial market power, order the ocean carrier to comply with\nany of the ocean carrier’s obligations under Division 9.\n\n(2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the\nRegistrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the\nregister of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market\npower.",
      "skos:definition": "non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market\npower\n\n(1) Subject to sections 10.55 and 10.56, the Minister may, by writing\nserved on a registered non-conference ocean carrier with\nsubstantial market power, order the ocean carrier to comply with\nany of the ocean carrier’s obligations under Division 9.\n\n(2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the\nRegistrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the\nregister of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market\npower.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-164-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-164-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "410ece77ea8ccc33cd22081343e2d85bf973c48062228a7f7595b5df3fda3f41"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-164",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 54  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to obligations of",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market\npower\n\n(1) Subject to sections 10.55 and 10.56, the Minister may, by writing\nserved on a registered non-conference ocean carrier with\nsubstantial market power, order the ocean carrier to comply with\nany of the ocean carrier’s obligations under Division 9.\n\n(2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the\nRegistrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the\nregister of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market\npower."
    },
