    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(5) 58  Investigation and report by Commission on application by",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-168-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Without limiting subsection (1), each of the following persons shall\nbe taken to be a person affected by the conduct of a registered\nnon-conference ocean carrier with substantial market power:\n\n(a) a designated shipper body;\n\n(b) in the case of an investigation relating to outwards liner cargo\nshipping services—an Australian flag shipping operator;\n\n(c) a shipper who uses, or may reasonably be expected to need to\nuse, outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner\ncargo shipping services provided, or proposed to be provided,\non the trade route specified in relation to the ocean carrier in\nthe register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial\nmarket power;\n\n(d) an association representing shippers who use, or may\nreasonably be expected to need to use, such services.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Without limiting subsection (1), each of the following persons shall\nbe taken to be a person affected by the conduct of a registered\nnon-conference ocean carrier with substantial market power:\n\n(a) a designated shipper body;\n\n(b) in the case of an investigation relating to outwards liner cargo\nshipping services—an Australian flag shipping operator;\n\n(c) a shipper who uses, or may reasonably be expected to need to\nuse, outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner\ncargo shipping services provided, or proposed to be provided,\non the trade route specified in relation to the ocean carrier in\nthe register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial\nmarket power;\n\n(d) an association representing shippers who use, or may\nreasonably be expected to need to use, such services.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168-ss-5-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-168-ss-5-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "02e98cfbb96b9c5e556885e0a4a1fd3542acdb568abb30dbdd4f9e9a3373b341",
      "skos:note": "List of persons affected by the conduct of a registered non-conference ocean carrier with substantial market power"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-168-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(5) 58  Investigation and report by Commission on application by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Without limiting subsection (1), each of the following persons shall\nbe taken to be a person affected by the conduct of a registered\nnon-conference ocean carrier with substantial market power:\n\n(a) a designated shipper body;\n\n(b) in the case of an investigation relating to outwards liner cargo\nshipping services—an Australian flag shipping operator;\n\n(c) a shipper who uses, or may reasonably be expected to need to\nuse, outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner\ncargo shipping services provided, or proposed to be provided,\non the trade route specified in relation to the ocean carrier in\nthe register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial\nmarket power;\n\n(d) an association representing shippers who use, or may\nreasonably be expected to need to use, such services."
    },
