    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-169",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 59  Undertakings by ocean carrier",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-169"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.93",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A registered non-conference ocean carrier with substantial market\npower may, at any time, offer to give an undertaking to do, or not\nto do, a specified act or thing.\n\n(2) The offer must be:\n\n(a) in the appropriate prescribed form; and\n\n(b) made to the Minister in accordance with the regulations.\n\n(3) If the Minister accepts the offer, the Minister may do one or more\nof the following:\n\n(a) revoke any reference made to the Commission under\nsection 10.57 in relation to the ocean carrier;\n\n(b) direct the Commission, in writing, to cease holding any\ninvestigation being held by it under section 10.58 in relation\nto the ocean carrier;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A registered non-conference ocean carrier with substantial market\npower may, at any time, offer to give an undertaking to do, or not\nto do, a specified act or thing.\n\n(2) The offer must be:\n\n(a) in the appropriate prescribed form; and\n\n(b) made to the Minister in accordance with the regulations.\n\n(3) If the Minister accepts the offer, the Minister may do one or more\nof the following:\n\n(a) revoke any reference made to the Commission under\nsection 10.57 in relation to the ocean carrier;\n\n(b) direct the Commission, in writing, to cease holding any\ninvestigation being held by it under section 10.58 in relation\nto the ocean carrier;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-169-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-169-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-169-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a39a431b6507fe9038fccbbe36fb29a023bb51a5e6a875fb1aacdb5890f5d9b9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-169",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 59  Undertakings by ocean carrier",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 93,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A registered non-conference ocean carrier with substantial market\npower may, at any time, offer to give an undertaking to do, or not\nto do, a specified act or thing.\n\n(2) The offer must be:\n\n(a) in the appropriate prescribed form; and\n\n(b) made to the Minister in accordance with the regulations.\n\n(3) If the Minister accepts the offer, the Minister may do one or more\nof the following:\n\n(a) revoke any reference made to the Commission under\nsection 10.57 in relation to the ocean carrier;\n\n(b) direct the Commission, in writing, to cease holding any\ninvestigation being held by it under section 10.58 in relation\nto the ocean carrier;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
