    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-171",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 61  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to pricing practices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-171"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "etc.\n\n(1) Subject to section 10.62, the Minister may, by writing served on an\nocean carrier, order the ocean carrier not to engage in a pricing\npractice.\n\n(2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the\nRegistrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the\nregister of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices.",
      "skos:definition": "etc.\n\n(1) Subject to section 10.62, the Minister may, by writing served on an\nocean carrier, order the ocean carrier not to engage in a pricing\npractice.\n\n(2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the\nRegistrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the\nregister of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-171-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-171-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "41b387a9617d9ffde9dc713bb94531bfc48d834db2fdc78d61c2040332d7bd35"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-171",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 61  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to pricing practices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 95,
      "values:originalText": "etc.\n\n(1) Subject to section 10.62, the Minister may, by writing served on an\nocean carrier, order the ocean carrier not to engage in a pricing\npractice.\n\n(2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the\nRegistrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the\nregister of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices."
    },
