    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 62  Circumstances in which Minister may exercise powers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-172"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "The Minister shall not make an order under subsection 10.61(1)\nunless:\n\n(a) the Minister is satisfied:\n\n(i) that the ocean carrier concerned has engaged in the\npricing practice concerned in relation to outwards liner\ncargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping\nservices provided on a particular trade route;\n\n(ii) that the practice has resulted in the freight rates charged\nby the ocean carrier for all or some outwards liner cargo\nshipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping\nservices provided on the trade route being less than\nnormal freight rates for services of that kind (as\ndetermined in accordance with section 10.66);\n\n(iii) that the practice is of such a magnitude or such a\nrecurring or systematic character that it has prevented or\nhindered, or threatens to prevent or hinder, the provision\nof outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards\nliner cargo shipping services on the trade route that are:\n\n(A) efficient and economical; and\n\n(B) provided at the capacity and frequency\nreasonably required to meet the needs of\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "The Minister shall not make an order under subsection 10.61(1)\nunless:\n\n(a) the Minister is satisfied:\n\n(i) that the ocean carrier concerned has engaged in the\npricing practice concerned in relation to outwards liner\ncargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping\nservices provided on a particular trade route;\n\n(ii) that the practice has resulted in the freight rates charged\nby the ocean carrier for all or some outwards liner cargo\nshipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping\nservices provided on the trade route being less than\nnormal freight rates for services of that kind (as\ndetermined in accordance with section 10.66);\n\n(iii) that the practice is of such a magnitude or such a\nrecurring or systematic character that it has prevented or\nhindered, or threatens to prevent or hinder, the provision\nof outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards\nliner cargo shipping services on the trade route that are:\n\n(A) efficient and economical; and\n\n(B) provided at the capacity and frequency\nreasonably required to meet the needs of\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a3d40349a4cdcfe14f298fc1caca98b4ebbd46897ec8c55f7d9e1ab1b6064142",
      "skos:note": "Minister cannot make an order under subsection 10.61(1) without certain conditions being met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-172",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 62  Circumstances in which Minister may exercise powers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 95,
      "values:originalText": "The Minister shall not make an order under subsection 10.61(1)\nunless:\n\n(a) the Minister is satisfied:\n\n(i) that the ocean carrier concerned has engaged in the\npricing practice concerned in relation to outwards liner\ncargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping\nservices provided on a particular trade route;\n\n(ii) that the practice has resulted in the freight rates charged\nby the ocean carrier for all or some outwards liner cargo\nshipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping\nservices provided on the trade route being less than\nnormal freight rates for services of that kind (as\ndetermined in accordance with section 10.66);\n\n(iii) that the practice is of such a magnitude or such a\nrecurring or systematic character that it has prevented or\nhindered, or threatens to prevent or hinder, the provision\nof outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards\nliner cargo shipping services on the trade route that are:\n\n(A) efficient and economical; and\n\n(B) provided at the capacity and frequency\nreasonably required to meet the needs of\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Minister is prohibited from making an order under subsection 10.61(1)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Minister shall not make an order under subsection 10.61(1)",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Minister must not make an order under subsection 10.61(1) unless..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The conditions overlap with the requirements for making an order under subsection 10.61(1)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the practice is of such a magnitude or such a recurring or systematic character that...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...it has prevented or hindered, or threatens to prevent or hinder, the provision of outwards liner cargo shipping services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The conditions imply that the Minister must consider the impact of the pricing practice on freight rates",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the Minister is satisfied that...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the freight rates charged by the ocean carrier for all or some outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on the trade route being less than normal"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Propagation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The conditions propagate to other requirements for making an order under subsection 10.61(1)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the practice has resulted in freight rates being less than normal",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...and the Minister must also consider the impact of the pricing practice on the provision of outwards liner cargo shipping services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-172-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Inference",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The conditions infer that the Minister must have a certain level of knowledge about the pricing practice and its impact on freight rates",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the Minister is satisfied that...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...and has prevented or hindered, or threatens to prevent or hinder, the provision of outwards liner cargo shipping services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-173",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 63  Investigation and report by Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-173"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, on the complaint of an affected person or\notherwise, refer to the Commission for investigation and report the\nquestion whether grounds exist for the Minister to be satisfied, in\nrelation to an ocean carrier in relation to outwards liner cargo\nshipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided\non a trade route, of the matters referred to in paragraph 10.62(a).\n\n(2) The Commission shall hold an investigation into the question and\nreport to the Minister.\n\n(3) In its investigation, the Commission shall give special\nconsideration to any matters specified in the reference as matters to\nbe given special consideration by the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, on the complaint of an affected person or\notherwise, refer to the Commission for investigation and report the\nquestion whether grounds exist for the Minister to be satisfied, in\nrelation to an ocean carrier in relation to outwards liner cargo\nshipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided\non a trade route, of the matters referred to in paragraph 10.62(a).\n\n(2) The Commission shall hold an investigation into the question and\nreport to the Minister.\n\n(3) In its investigation, the Commission shall give special\nconsideration to any matters specified in the reference as matters to\nbe given special consideration by the Commission.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-173-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-173-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-173-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "300a9d17607aab55544a3512a1ba3044b8fd96435a95eb488c2f73cd62266c9b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-173",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 63  Investigation and report by Commission",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, on the complaint of an affected person or\notherwise, refer to the Commission for investigation and report the\nquestion whether grounds exist for the Minister to be satisfied, in\nrelation to an ocean carrier in relation to outwards liner cargo\nshipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided\non a trade route, of the matters referred to in paragraph 10.62(a).\n\n(2) The Commission shall hold an investigation into the question and\nreport to the Minister.\n\n(3) In its investigation, the Commission shall give special\nconsideration to any matters specified in the reference as matters to\nbe given special consideration by the Commission."
    },
