    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 66  Determination of normal freight rates for shipping services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-176"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The normal freight rates for outwards liner cargo shipping services\nor inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on a trade route\nare, subject to subsection (2), the freight rates actually charged in\nthe ordinary course of shipping business for the same or similar\nservices on the same or a comparable trade route by ocean carriers\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The normal freight rates for outwards liner cargo shipping services\nor inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on a trade route\nare, subject to subsection (2), the freight rates actually charged in\nthe ordinary course of shipping business for the same or similar\nservices on the same or a comparable trade route by ocean carriers\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed4b95cdf9e70fc675e7a775fa5d2d405abd38d5f354236ac954c42f4e4b95c1",
      "skos:note": "Determine normal freight rates for shipping services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-176",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 66  Determination of normal freight rates for shipping services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 97,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The normal freight rates for outwards liner cargo shipping services\nor inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on a trade route\nare, subject to subsection (2), the freight rates actually charged in\nthe ordinary course of shipping business for the same or similar\nservices on the same or a comparable trade route by ocean carriers\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must determine",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 67  Determination of whether practice contrary to national",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-177"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "interest\n\n(1) In determining whether a pricing practice in relation to outwards\nliner cargo shipping services is contrary to the national interest,\nregard shall be had, in particular, to:\n\n(a) the effect that the practice has had, or is likely to have, in\nrelation to:\n\n(i) continued access by Australian exporters to outwards\nliner cargo shipping services of adequate frequency and\nreliability at freight rates that are internationally\ncompetitive; and\n\n(ii) stable access to export markets for exporters in all\nStates and Territories;\n\n(b) the extent to which any advantages provided by the practice\nor similar practices are enjoyed by competitors of Australian\nexporters; and\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nUnfair pricing practices  Division 11\n\nSection 10.67\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(c) the effect that denial of any advantages provided by the\npractice would have on the competitiveness of Australian\nindustries.\n\n(2) Subsection (3) applies when determining whether a pricing practice\nin relation to inwards liner cargo shipping services is contrary to\nthe national interest.\n\n(3) Regard must be had, in particular, to the effect that the practice has\nhad, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by\nAustralian importers in all States and Territories to inwards liner\ncargo shipping services that:\n\n(a) are of adequate frequency and reliability; and\n\n(b) are at freight rates that are internationally competitive.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "interest\n\n(1) In determining whether a pricing practice in relation to outwards\nliner cargo shipping services is contrary to the national interest,\nregard shall be had, in particular, to:\n\n(a) the effect that the practice has had, or is likely to have, in\nrelation to:\n\n(i) continued access by Australian exporters to outwards\nliner cargo shipping services of adequate frequency and\nreliability at freight rates that are internationally\ncompetitive; and\n\n(ii) stable access to export markets for exporters in all\nStates and Territories;\n\n(b) the extent to which any advantages provided by the practice\nor similar practices are enjoyed by competitors of Australian\nexporters; and\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nUnfair pricing practices  Division 11\n\nSection 10.67\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(c) the effect that denial of any advantages provided by the\npractice would have on the competitiveness of Australian\nindustries.\n\n(2) Subsection (3) applies when determining whether a pricing practice\nin relation to inwards liner cargo shipping services is contrary to\nthe national interest.\n\n(3) Regard must be had, in particular, to the effect that the practice has\nhad, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by\nAustralian importers in all States and Territories to inwards liner\ncargo shipping services that:\n\n(a) are of adequate frequency and reliability; and\n\n(b) are at freight rates that are internationally competitive.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "828408e40d4fe651488b14696b60b613c9683ab9862e03f4e72aec7c1fda7635"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-177",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 67  Determination of whether practice contrary to national",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "interest\n\n(1) In determining whether a pricing practice in relation to outwards\nliner cargo shipping services is contrary to the national interest,\nregard shall be had, in particular, to:\n\n(a) the effect that the practice has had, or is likely to have, in\nrelation to:\n\n(i) continued access by Australian exporters to outwards\nliner cargo shipping services of adequate frequency and\nreliability at freight rates that are internationally\ncompetitive; and\n\n(ii) stable access to export markets for exporters in all\nStates and Territories;\n\n(b) the extent to which any advantages provided by the practice\nor similar practices are enjoyed by competitors of Australian\nexporters; and\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nUnfair pricing practices  Division 11\n\nSection 10.67\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(c) the effect that denial of any advantages provided by the\npractice would have on the competitiveness of Australian\nindustries.\n\n(2) Subsection (3) applies when determining whether a pricing practice\nin relation to inwards liner cargo shipping services is contrary to\nthe national interest.\n\n(3) Regard must be had, in particular, to the effect that the practice has\nhad, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by\nAustralian importers in all States and Territories to inwards liner\ncargo shipping services that:\n\n(a) are of adequate frequency and reliability; and\n\n(b) are at freight rates that are internationally competitive.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(1) 67  Determination of whether practice contrary to national",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-177-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
