      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Regard must be had, in particular, to the effect that the practice has\nhad, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by\nAustralian importers in all States and Territories to inwards liner\ncargo shipping services that:\n\n(a) are of adequate frequency and reliability; and\n\n(b) are at freight rates that are internationally competitive.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Regard must be had, in particular, to the effect that the practice has\nhad, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by\nAustralian importers in all States and Territories to inwards liner\ncargo shipping services that:\n\n(a) are of adequate frequency and reliability; and\n\n(b) are at freight rates that are internationally competitive.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-177-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "633eaccb04c4f9e8b88e6c5c8a49bd69862f25857a46802e144a62b4a1531d4c",
      "skos:note": "Regard must be had to the effect that practice has had, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by Australian importers in all States and Territories."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-177-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(3) 67  Determination of whether practice contrary to national",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Regard must be had, in particular, to the effect that the practice has\nhad, or is likely to have, in relation to continuous stable access by\nAustralian importers in all States and Territories to inwards liner\ncargo shipping services that:\n\n(a) are of adequate frequency and reliability; and\n\n(b) are at freight rates that are internationally competitive.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
