    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-178",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 68  Ocean carrier who provides international liner cargo shipping",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-178"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "services to have registered agent\n\n(1) Every ocean carrier who provides international liner cargo shipping\nservices shall, at all times, be represented for the purposes of this\nAct by a person who:\n\n(a) is an individual resident in Australia;\n\n(b) has been appointed by the ocean carrier as the ocean carrier’s\nagent for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(c) is specified in the register of ocean carrier agents as the ocean\ncarrier’s agent.\n\n(2) An ocean carrier who, without reasonable excuse, contravenes\nsubsection (1) commits an offence punishable, on conviction, by a\nfine not exceeding:\n\n(a) in the case of a natural person—20 penalty units; and\n\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—100 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "services to have registered agent\n\n(1) Every ocean carrier who provides international liner cargo shipping\nservices shall, at all times, be represented for the purposes of this\nAct by a person who:\n\n(a) is an individual resident in Australia;\n\n(b) has been appointed by the ocean carrier as the ocean carrier’s\nagent for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(c) is specified in the register of ocean carrier agents as the ocean\ncarrier’s agent.\n\n(2) An ocean carrier who, without reasonable excuse, contravenes\nsubsection (1) commits an offence punishable, on conviction, by a\nfine not exceeding:\n\n(a) in the case of a natural person—20 penalty units; and\n\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—100 penalty units.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-178-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-178-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "41028dbe37c68f8c35f11fce46619cb49f532e2f07575df1ddfef94c1793b265"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-178",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 68  Ocean carrier who provides international liner cargo shipping",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "services to have registered agent\n\n(1) Every ocean carrier who provides international liner cargo shipping\nservices shall, at all times, be represented for the purposes of this\nAct by a person who:\n\n(a) is an individual resident in Australia;\n\n(b) has been appointed by the ocean carrier as the ocean carrier’s\nagent for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(c) is specified in the register of ocean carrier agents as the ocean\ncarrier’s agent.\n\n(2) An ocean carrier who, without reasonable excuse, contravenes\nsubsection (1) commits an offence punishable, on conviction, by a\nfine not exceeding:\n\n(a) in the case of a natural person—20 penalty units; and\n\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—100 penalty units."
    },
