    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-180",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 70  Application by ocean carrier for registration of agent",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-180"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An ocean carrier may apply for the registration of a person as the\nocean carrier’s agent for the purposes of this Act.\n\n(2) The person must:\n\n(a) be an individual resident in Australia;\n\n(b) have been appointed by the ocean carrier as the ocean\ncarrier’s agent for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(c) have an address for service in Australia.\n\n(3) The application must be:\n\n(a) made to the Registrar;\n\n(b) made in the prescribed form and in accordance with the\nregulations; and\n\n(c) accompanied by the prescribed fee.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An ocean carrier may apply for the registration of a person as the\nocean carrier’s agent for the purposes of this Act.\n\n(2) The person must:\n\n(a) be an individual resident in Australia;\n\n(b) have been appointed by the ocean carrier as the ocean\ncarrier’s agent for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(c) have an address for service in Australia.\n\n(3) The application must be:\n\n(a) made to the Registrar;\n\n(b) made in the prescribed form and in accordance with the\nregulations; and\n\n(c) accompanied by the prescribed fee.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-180-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-180-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-180-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "74a64b96fa401ffd5bbae3b78942203238e7c9c73ed842a728d7b0a28a63f900"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-180",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 70  Application by ocean carrier for registration of agent",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An ocean carrier may apply for the registration of a person as the\nocean carrier’s agent for the purposes of this Act.\n\n(2) The person must:\n\n(a) be an individual resident in Australia;\n\n(b) have been appointed by the ocean carrier as the ocean\ncarrier’s agent for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(c) have an address for service in Australia.\n\n(3) The application must be:\n\n(a) made to the Registrar;\n\n(b) made in the prescribed form and in accordance with the\nregulations; and\n\n(c) accompanied by the prescribed fee."
    },
