      "values:originalText": "(3) A notice under paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c):\n\n(a) must be in the appropriate prescribed form;\n\n(b) must be given to the Registrar in accordance with the\nregulations; and\n\n(c) may be expressed to take effect on and from a specified\nfuture day.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A notice under paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c):\n\n(a) must be in the appropriate prescribed form;\n\n(b) must be given to the Registrar in accordance with the\nregulations; and\n\n(c) may be expressed to take effect on and from a specified\nfuture day.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-182"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-182-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-182-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e35907f92366555707842c921af0b5db06c3f68871eb5099c0df5e185d1558e6",
      "skos:note": "Notice must be in prescribed form and given to Registrar.",
      "dc:description": "specified future day"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-182-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(3) Section 10",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A notice under paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c):\n\n(a) must be in the appropriate prescribed form;\n\n(b) must be given to the Registrar in accordance with the\nregulations; and\n\n(c) may be expressed to take effect on and from a specified\nfuture day."
    },
