      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Where an ocean carrier properly gives a notice under\nparagraph (1)(a) or (b), the Registrar shall immediately make such\nvariations to the particulars entered in the register of ocean carrier\nagents in relation to the ocean carrier as are necessary to give effect\nto the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Where an ocean carrier properly gives a notice under\nparagraph (1)(a) or (b), the Registrar shall immediately make such\nvariations to the particulars entered in the register of ocean carrier\nagents in relation to the ocean carrier as are necessary to give effect\nto the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-182"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
