    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-182-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(5) Section 10",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-182-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where an ocean carrier properly gives a notice under\nparagraph (1)(c), the Registrar shall make such variations (if any)\nto the particulars entered in the register of ocean carrier agents in\nrelation to the ocean carrier as the Registrar considers necessary or\ndesirable to give effect to the notice.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nExemption orders for inwards conference agreements etc.  Division 12A\n\nSection 10.72A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Where an ocean carrier properly gives a notice under\nparagraph (1)(c), the Registrar shall make such variations (if any)\nto the particulars entered in the register of ocean carrier agents in\nrelation to the ocean carrier as the Registrar considers necessary or\ndesirable to give effect to the notice.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nExemption orders for inwards conference agreements etc.  Division 12A\n\nSection 10.72A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-182"
      },
