      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, each of the following provisions is\nan eligible regulatory provision:\n\n(a) subsection 10.07(2);\n\n(b) section 10.08;\n\n(c) paragraph 10.28(1)(ba);\n\n(d) subsection 10.29(1A);\n\n(e) section 10.40;\n\n(f) section 10.41;\n\n(g) section 10.43;\n\n(h) subparagraph 10.45(1)(a)(iv);\n\n(i) subsection 10.45(3);\n\n(j) subsection 10.45(4);\n\n(k) section 10.52;\n\n(l) subparagraph 10.62(a)(i).\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of this section, each of the following provisions is\nan eligible regulatory provision:\n\n(a) subsection 10.07(2);\n\n(b) section 10.08;\n\n(c) paragraph 10.28(1)(ba);\n\n(d) subsection 10.29(1A);\n\n(e) section 10.40;\n\n(f) section 10.41;\n\n(g) section 10.43;\n\n(h) subparagraph 10.45(1)(a)(iv);\n\n(i) subsection 10.45(3);\n\n(j) subsection 10.45(4);\n\n(k) section 10.52;\n\n(l) subparagraph 10.62(a)(i).\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
