      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "An exemption order may be expressed to be subject to such\nconditions as are specified in the order.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nGeneral provisions relating to registers and conference agreement files  Division 13\n\nSection 10.73\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
