    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-190",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 76  Correction of clerical errors and other mistakes in certain",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-190"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "registers etc.\n\nWhere the Registrar is satisfied that a clerical error or other\nmistake exists in particulars entered in a register kept by the\nRegistrar or that matters included in particulars entered in a register\nkept by the Registrar are obsolete, the Registrar may vary the\nparticulars for the purpose of correcting the error or mistake or\nremoving the obsolete matters.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "registers etc.\n\nWhere the Registrar is satisfied that a clerical error or other\nmistake exists in particulars entered in a register kept by the\nRegistrar or that matters included in particulars entered in a register\nkept by the Registrar are obsolete, the Registrar may vary the\nparticulars for the purpose of correcting the error or mistake or\nremoving the obsolete matters.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-190-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-190-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9409d295d808581d9ec12a1bfbb3705ae669c0397afb5c6905f31e2b465346a2",
      "skos:note": "The Registrar may correct clerical errors or mistakes in registers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-190",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 76  Correction of clerical errors and other mistakes in certain",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 105,
      "values:originalText": "registers etc.\n\nWhere the Registrar is satisfied that a clerical error or other\nmistake exists in particulars entered in a register kept by the\nRegistrar or that matters included in particulars entered in a register\nkept by the Registrar are obsolete, the Registrar may vary the\nparticulars for the purpose of correcting the error or mistake or\nremoving the obsolete matters.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
