      "cml:integrityHash": "e41961771c0a359de9a1f2a07914394aaaf28e8a5791d82f16bb0fd12b0f332b",
      "skos:note": "Division 1 of Part IX does not apply in relation to a review by the Tribunal of a decision of the Commission of a kind mentioned in section 10.82A."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-199",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 82C  Provisions that do not apply in relation to a Tribunal review",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 109,
      "values:originalText": "Division 1 of Part IX does not apply in relation to a review by the\nTribunal of a decision of the Commission of a kind mentioned in\nsection 10.82A.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
