    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-200",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 82D  Review by Tribunal",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-200"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.110",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following decisions of\nthe Minister is a reviewable decision:\n\n(a) a decision to:\n\n(i) give; or\n\n(ii) refuse to give;\n\na direction under subsection 10.44(1), subsection 10.46(3),\nparagraph 10.49(3)(b), subsection 10.51(1),\nsubsection 10.56(3) or paragraph 10.59(3)(b);\n\n(b) a decision under section 10.49, 10.59 or 10.64 to:\n\n(i) accept an offer; or\n\n(ii) refuse to accept an offer;\n\n(c) a decision under paragraph 10.49(3)(a), 10.59(3)(a) or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following decisions of\nthe Minister is a reviewable decision:\n\n(a) a decision to:\n\n(i) give; or\n\n(ii) refuse to give;\n\na direction under subsection 10.44(1), subsection 10.46(3),\nparagraph 10.49(3)(b), subsection 10.51(1),\nsubsection 10.56(3) or paragraph 10.59(3)(b);\n\n(b) a decision under section 10.49, 10.59 or 10.64 to:\n\n(i) accept an offer; or\n\n(ii) refuse to accept an offer;\n\n(c) a decision under paragraph 10.49(3)(a), 10.59(3)(a) or",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-200-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-200-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-200-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6580f187f22b7955fb45c3c62d156cbe15f8220973410201b7f590aa55f0d6cf",
      "skos:note": "List of reviewable decisions by Minister"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-200",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 82D  Review by Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 110,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following decisions of\nthe Minister is a reviewable decision:\n\n(a) a decision to:\n\n(i) give; or\n\n(ii) refuse to give;\n\na direction under subsection 10.44(1), subsection 10.46(3),\nparagraph 10.49(3)(b), subsection 10.51(1),\nsubsection 10.56(3) or paragraph 10.59(3)(b);\n\n(b) a decision under section 10.49, 10.59 or 10.64 to:\n\n(i) accept an offer; or\n\n(ii) refuse to accept an offer;\n\n(c) a decision under paragraph 10.49(3)(a), 10.59(3)(a) or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-200-norm",
