      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of a review, the Tribunal may have regard to any\ninformation given, documents produced or evidence given to the\nMinister in connection with the making of the decision to which\nthe review relates.\nNote:\nDivision 2 of Part IX applies to proceedings before the Tribunal.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of a review, the Tribunal may have regard to any\ninformation given, documents produced or evidence given to the\nMinister in connection with the making of the decision to which\nthe review relates.\nNote:\nDivision 2 of Part IX applies to proceedings before the Tribunal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-202"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-202-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
