      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(4) 82E  Functions and powers of Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of a review, the Tribunal may have regard to any\ninformation given, documents produced or evidence given to the\nMinister in connection with the making of the decision to which\nthe review relates.\nNote:\nDivision 2 of Part IX applies to proceedings before the Tribunal."
