      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) the Tribunal decides to set aside or vary a decision of the\nMinister; and\n\n(b) a register kept by the Registrar is not consistent with the\ndecision of the Tribunal;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) the Tribunal decides to set aside or vary a decision of the\nMinister; and\n\n(b) a register kept by the Registrar is not consistent with the\ndecision of the Tribunal;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
