    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-206",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 84  Review of decisions of Registrar",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-206"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.113",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of a reviewable decision.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.\nreviewable decision means a decision of the Registrar under this\nPart, other than:\n\n(a) a decision to provisionally or finally register a conference\nagreement; or\n\n(b) a decision as to the form of a register.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of a reviewable decision.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.\nreviewable decision means a decision of the Registrar under this\nPart, other than:\n\n(a) a decision to provisionally or finally register a conference\nagreement; or\n\n(b) a decision as to the form of a register.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-206-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-206-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "25ad5819dde9944cae8557a463160b344ea57a26e5fac4f364ea8cb028474d04"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-206",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 84  Review of decisions of Registrar",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 113,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of a reviewable decision.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.\nreviewable decision means a decision of the Registrar under this\nPart, other than:\n\n(a) a decision to provisionally or finally register a conference\nagreement; or\n\n(b) a decision as to the form of a register."
    },
