      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "87  Notification by Commission of references etc.\n\nThe Commission may make public, in such manner as it considers\nappropriate:\n\n(a) receipt of references under subsections 10.47(1), 10.50(1),",
      "skos:definition": "87  Notification by Commission of references etc.\n\nThe Commission may make public, in such manner as it considers\nappropriate:\n\n(a) receipt of references under subsections 10.47(1), 10.50(1),",
