      "skos:note": "Commission may make public certain references"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-209",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Section 10",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "87  Notification by Commission of references etc.\n\nThe Commission may make public, in such manner as it considers\nappropriate:\n\n(a) receipt of references under subsections 10.47(1), 10.50(1),"
