      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(b) decisions made by it under subsections 10.48(2), 10.48(2A)\nand 10.58(2) to hold investigations.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nMiscellaneous  Division 15\n\nSection 10.88\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(b) decisions made by it under subsections 10.48(2), 10.48(2A)\nand 10.58(2) to hold investigations.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nMiscellaneous  Division 15\n\nSection 10.88\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-210-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "81bc294d1ad33a478c41407686fda88e77eb795572a27c450284f58e80e1a395",
      "skos:note": "Investigations may be held under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-210",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 57(1) and 10.63(1); and",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(b) decisions made by it under subsections 10.48(2), 10.48(2A)\nand 10.58(2) to hold investigations.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nInternational liner cargo shipping  Part X\nMiscellaneous  Division 15\n\nSection 10.88\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-210-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-210"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-211",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 88  Exclusion of documents etc. from register of Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-10-211"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.115",
      "values:originalText": "investigations\n\n(1) Where:\n\n(a) a person gives a document to the Commission in relation to\nan investigation; or\n\n(b) a person makes an oral submission to the Commission in\nrelation to an investigation;\nthe person may, at the same time, request that the document, or the\nparticulars of the submission, be excluded from the register\nbecause of the confidential nature of matters contained in the\ndocument or submission.\n\n(2) If the Commission is satisfied that the request is justified because\ndisclosure of matters contained in the document or submission\nwould disclose:\n\n(a) trade secrets;\n\n(b) information (other than trade secrets) having a commercial\nvalue that would be, or could reasonably be expected to be,\ndestroyed or diminished if the information were disclosed; or\n\n(c) any other information concerning a person in relation to the\nperson’s business or professional affairs, or concerning the\nbusiness, commercial or financial affairs of an organisation\nor undertaking, the disclosure of which would, or could\nreasonably be expected to, unreasonably affect the person\nadversely in relation to the person’s lawful business or\nprofessional affairs or the organisation or undertaking in\nrelation to its lawful business, commercial or financial\naffairs;\nthe Commission shall exclude the document, or the particulars of\nthe submission, from the register.\n\n(3) If:\n\n(a) the Commission refuses a request to exclude a document\nfrom the register; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "investigations\n\n(1) Where:\n\n(a) a person gives a document to the Commission in relation to\nan investigation; or\n\n(b) a person makes an oral submission to the Commission in\nrelation to an investigation;\nthe person may, at the same time, request that the document, or the\nparticulars of the submission, be excluded from the register\nbecause of the confidential nature of matters contained in the\ndocument or submission.\n\n(2) If the Commission is satisfied that the request is justified because\ndisclosure of matters contained in the document or submission\nwould disclose:\n\n(a) trade secrets;\n\n(b) information (other than trade secrets) having a commercial\nvalue that would be, or could reasonably be expected to be,\ndestroyed or diminished if the information were disclosed; or\n\n(c) any other information concerning a person in relation to the\nperson’s business or professional affairs, or concerning the\nbusiness, commercial or financial affairs of an organisation\nor undertaking, the disclosure of which would, or could\nreasonably be expected to, unreasonably affect the person\nadversely in relation to the person’s lawful business or\nprofessional affairs or the organisation or undertaking in\nrelation to its lawful business, commercial or financial\naffairs;\nthe Commission shall exclude the document, or the particulars of\nthe submission, from the register.\n\n(3) If:\n\n(a) the Commission refuses a request to exclude a document\nfrom the register; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-211-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-211-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-211-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d180b942f62929aca7e987fd745e0c6d48b11c1ffa97b4f139f8ff0cfbb60e82"
    },
    {
