      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Schedule 2 applies as a law of the Commonwealth to the conduct\nof corporations, and in relation to contraventions of Chapter 2, 3 or\n4 of Schedule 2 by corporations.\nNote:\nSections 5 and 6 of this Act extend the application of this Part (and\ntherefore extend the application of the Australian Consumer Law as a\nlaw of the Commonwealth).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Schedule 2 applies as a law of the Commonwealth to the conduct\nof corporations, and in relation to contraventions of Chapter 2, 3 or\n4 of Schedule 2 by corporations.\nNote:\nSections 5 and 6 of this Act extend the application of this Part (and\ntherefore extend the application of the Australian Consumer Law as a\nlaw of the Commonwealth).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0af332bb8b364e440e6b568d4c09ad9728535f3639d516bc5820105e2b9a4056",
      "skos:note": "Application of the Australian Consumer Law to corporations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-131-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "131(1) Application of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Schedule 2 applies as a law of the Commonwealth to the conduct\nof corporations, and in relation to contraventions of Chapter 2, 3 or\n4 of Schedule 2 by corporations.\nNote:\nSections 5 and 6 of this Act extend the application of this Part (and\ntherefore extend the application of the Australian Consumer Law as a\nlaw of the Commonwealth)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
