    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "131(3) Application of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-131-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The table of contents in Schedule 2 is additional information that is\nnot part of this Act. Information in the table may be added to or\nedited in any published version of this Act.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Division\n\nSection 131A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The table of contents in Schedule 2 is additional information that is\nnot part of this Act. Information in the table may be added to or\nedited in any published version of this Act.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Division\n\nSection 131A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "036e73a516c3cd7cf21e2e23c416baac3efaf46dfba4cd422e324a2a5a98f6c5",
      "skos:note": "Information in the table may be added to or edited in any published version of this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-131-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "131(3) Application of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The table of contents in Schedule 2 is additional information that is\nnot part of this Act. Information in the table may be added to or\nedited in any published version of this Act.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Division\n\nSection 131A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-131-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
