    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-132d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "132D Recommendation after conclusion of conference",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-132d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(1) As soon as is practicable after the conclusion of a conference held\nunder this Subdivision in relation to the proposed imposition of an\ninterim ban or permanent ban, the Commission must:\n\n(a) by written notice given to the Commonwealth Minister,\nrecommend that the Commonwealth Minister:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) As soon as is practicable after the conclusion of a conference held\nunder this Subdivision in relation to the proposed imposition of an\ninterim ban or permanent ban, the Commission must:\n\n(a) by written notice given to the Commonwealth Minister,\nrecommend that the Commonwealth Minister:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
