      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Commonwealth Minister must, by written notice published on\nthe internet, invite any person who supplied, or proposes to supply:\n\n(a) consumer goods of that kind; or\n\n(b) product related services of that kind;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-132e-ss-3",
