      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.131",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The period specified in the notice under subsection (2):\n\n(a) must be a period of at least 10 days, or such longer period as\nthe Commonwealth Minister specifies in the notice; and\n\n(b) must not commence before the day on which the notice is\npublished.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The period specified in the notice under subsection (2):\n\n(a) must be a period of at least 10 days, or such longer period as\nthe Commonwealth Minister specifies in the notice; and\n\n(b) must not commence before the day on which the notice is\npublished.",
      "values:partOf": {
