      "skos:note": "Suitable qualifications and experience required for inspector appointment"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-133-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "133(2) Appointment of inspectors",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 136,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Chairperson must not appoint a person as an inspector unless\nthe Chairperson is satisfied that the person has suitable\nqualifications and experience to exercise properly the powers of an\ninspector."
    },
