      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "133A(5) Identity cards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 136,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (3) does not apply if the identity card was lost or\ndestroyed.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this\nsubsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code.\nInspector must carry card"
    },
