    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "133B Power to enter premises to which the public has access—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-133b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "consumer goods\n\n(1) An inspector may enter premises in or from which a person, in\ntrade or commerce, supplies consumer goods, if the public has\naccess to the premises at the time of entry, for the purpose of\nascertaining whether:\n\n(a) any of those consumer goods will or may cause injury to any\nperson; or\n\n(b) a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of those\nconsumer goods will or may cause injury to any person;\nand remain on the premises for such a purpose while the public has\naccess to the premises.\n\n(2) While on the premises, the inspector may:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "consumer goods\n\n(1) An inspector may enter premises in or from which a person, in\ntrade or commerce, supplies consumer goods, if the public has\naccess to the premises at the time of entry, for the purpose of\nascertaining whether:\n\n(a) any of those consumer goods will or may cause injury to any\nperson; or\n\n(b) a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of those\nconsumer goods will or may cause injury to any person;\nand remain on the premises for such a purpose while the public has\naccess to the premises.\n\n(2) While on the premises, the inspector may:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133b-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29c8ba8f32d6884d45af1946a59374bd6596bce3dbbe6dda442638435a0c67b8"
    },
