    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133c-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "133C(1) Power to enter premises to which the public has access—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-133c-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.138",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commonwealth Minister or an inspector may give a disclosure\nnotice to a person (the notice recipient) if the person giving the\nnotice has reason to believe:\n\n(a) that the notice recipient is capable of giving information,\nproducing documents or giving evidence in relation to the\nsupply, or possible supply, in trade or commerce, of\nconsumer goods of a particular kind as specified in the\nnotice; and\n\n(b) that:\n\n(i) consumer goods of that kind will or may cause injury to\nany person; or\n\n(ii) a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of\nconsumer goods of that kind will or may cause injury to\nany person.\nProduct related services",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commonwealth Minister or an inspector may give a disclosure\nnotice to a person (the notice recipient) if the person giving the\nnotice has reason to believe:\n\n(a) that the notice recipient is capable of giving information,\nproducing documents or giving evidence in relation to the\nsupply, or possible supply, in trade or commerce, of\nconsumer goods of a particular kind as specified in the\nnotice; and\n\n(b) that:\n\n(i) consumer goods of that kind will or may cause injury to\nany person; or\n\n(ii) a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of\nconsumer goods of that kind will or may cause injury to\nany person.\nProduct related services",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133c"
