        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "133E(2) Self-incrimination",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-133e-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, in the case of an individual:\n\n(a) the information or evidence given, or the document\nproduced; and\n\n(b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the\ndocument;\nare not admissible in evidence against the individual:\n\n(c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or\n\n(d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against\nthe individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, in the case of an individual:\n\n(a) the information or evidence given, or the document\nproduced; and\n\n(b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the\ndocument;\nare not admissible in evidence against the individual:\n\n(c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or\n\n(d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against\nthe individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e12ec33580fa959333a89688fe4e5991fed1ffba1dddd32dc29ba2b9a3f7a49e",
      "skos:note": "Protection from self-incrimination in certain cases"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-133e-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "133E(2) Self-incrimination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 140,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, in the case of an individual:\n\n(a) the information or evidence given, or the document\nproduced; and\n\n(b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the\ndocument;\nare not admissible in evidence against the individual:\n\n(c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or\n\n(d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against\nthe individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
