      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is given a disclosure notice; and\n\n(b) the person refuses or fails to comply with the notice.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person undertakes to comply."
    },
    {
