      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.144",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This Division does not:\n\n(a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an\nalleged contravention of an infringement notice provision; or\n\n(b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under Chapter 4\nor Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to an\nalleged contravention of an infringement notice provision if:\n\n(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the\nalleged contravention; or\n\n(ii) an infringement notice issued to a person for the alleged\ncontravention is withdrawn under section 134G; or\n\n(c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the\npenalty specified in the infringement notice if the person\ndoes not comply with the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This Division does not:\n\n(a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an\nalleged contravention of an infringement notice provision; or\n\n(b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under Chapter 4\nor Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to an\nalleged contravention of an infringement notice provision if:\n\n(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the\nalleged contravention; or\n\n(ii) an infringement notice issued to a person for the alleged\ncontravention is withdrawn under section 134G; or\n\n(c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the\npenalty specified in the infringement notice if the person\ndoes not comply with the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "794349fc1d8ee22eb2d359896ca14ee926a47e8453b7fa41b0f98e1313d2e0e5",
      "skos:note": "Does not require an infringement notice to be issued for certain contraventions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-134-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "134(2) Purpose and effect of this Division",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 144,
      "values:originalText": "(2) This Division does not:\n\n(a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an\nalleged contravention of an infringement notice provision; or\n\n(b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under Chapter 4\nor Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to an\nalleged contravention of an infringement notice provision if:\n\n(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the\nalleged contravention; or\n\n(ii) an infringement notice issued to a person for the alleged\ncontravention is withdrawn under section 134G; or\n\n(c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the\npenalty specified in the infringement notice if the person\ndoes not comply with the notice."
    },
