    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "134A(4) Issuing an infringement notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-134a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.144",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:\n\n(a) is issued more than 12 months after the day on which the\ncontravention of the infringement notice provision is alleged\nto have occurred; or\n\n(b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of an\ninfringement notice provision by the person.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:\n\n(a) is issued more than 12 months after the day on which the\ncontravention of the infringement notice provision is alleged\nto have occurred; or\n\n(b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of an\ninfringement notice provision by the person.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "89b955d520fedc623979b5e1b95827814d5963d58845234908414a1dfe228076",
      "skos:note": "Infringement notice has no effect if issued more than 12 months after alleged contravention."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-134a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "134A(4) Issuing an infringement notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 144,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:\n\n(a) is issued more than 12 months after the day on which the\ncontravention of the infringement notice provision is alleged\nto have occurred; or\n\n(b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of an\ninfringement notice provision by the person."
    },
