      "cml:integrityHash": "53679ca367865683dd4fea06eacda9b5b9ce4e084c5d46facf95bf14c2f234d9",
      "skos:note": "Inspector's search-related powers in relation to premises where consumer goods are supplied."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135a",
