    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "135C Failure to answer questions or produce documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement under\nsubsection 135B(2); and\n\n(b) the person fails to comply with the requirement.\nPenalty:\n\n(a) if the person is a body corporate—150 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is not a body corporate—30 penalty units.\n\n(2) A person is not excused from:\n\n(a) answering a question; or\n\n(b) producing a document;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement under\nsubsection 135B(2); and\n\n(b) the person fails to comply with the requirement.\nPenalty:\n\n(a) if the person is a body corporate—150 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is not a body corporate—30 penalty units.\n\n(2) A person is not excused from:\n\n(a) answering a question; or\n\n(b) producing a document;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b94545bc97a19e2b0a24e0469ae1cc75eb4c71a20022edd6b97ccf5c57b31c74"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "135C Failure to answer questions or produce documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 157,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement under\nsubsection 135B(2); and\n\n(b) the person fails to comply with the requirement.\nPenalty:\n\n(a) if the person is a body corporate—150 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is not a body corporate—30 penalty units.\n\n(2) A person is not excused from:\n\n(a) answering a question; or\n\n(b) producing a document;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
