      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135f-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "135F(3) Announcement before entry under warrant",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135f-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\n(a) the inspector does not comply with subsection (1) because of\nsubsection (2); and\n\n(b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who\napparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises;\nthe inspector must, as soon as practicable after entering the\npremises, show his or her identity card to the occupier or other\nperson.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If:\n\n(a) the inspector does not comply with subsection (1) because of\nsubsection (2); and\n\n(b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who\napparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises;\nthe inspector must, as soon as practicable after entering the\npremises, show his or her identity card to the occupier or other\nperson.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135f"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135f-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135f-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c5a4529aaedb59ce8621ba9809b0e47bc96a3deba52ecac820524a36bda8ab7d",
      "skos:note": "Show identity card to occupier or representative upon entry",
      "dc:description": "Identity card"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135f-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "135F(3) Announcement before entry under warrant",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 159,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\n(a) the inspector does not comply with subsection (1) because of\nsubsection (2); and\n\n(b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who\napparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises;\nthe inspector must, as soon as practicable after entering the\npremises, show his or her identity card to the occupier or other\nperson.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135f-ss-3-norm",
