    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "135U Multiple embargo notices for the same consumer goods or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135u"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "product related services\n\nAn inspector must not give an embargo notice in relation to\nconsumer goods, or product related services, of a particular kind if:\n\n(a) an embargo notice (the earlier embargo notice) has already\nbeen given in relation to consumer goods, or product related\nservices, of that kind; and\n\n(b) the embargo period for the earlier embargo notice did not end\nat least 5 days ago.",
      "skos:definition": "product related services\n\nAn inspector must not give an embargo notice in relation to\nconsumer goods, or product related services, of a particular kind if:\n\n(a) an embargo notice (the earlier embargo notice) has already\nbeen given in relation to consumer goods, or product related\nservices, of that kind; and\n\n(b) the embargo period for the earlier embargo notice did not end\nat least 5 days ago.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6d37ec7981726662d22a441c38310e7bab9bee0eaad14e86a34f5ea5d257f9b7",
      "skos:note": "Inspector cannot give embargo notice for same consumer goods or product related services if earlier notice has not ended at least 5 days ago."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135u",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "135U Multiple embargo notices for the same consumer goods or",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "product related services\n\nAn inspector must not give an embargo notice in relation to\nconsumer goods, or product related services, of a particular kind if:\n\n(a) an embargo notice (the earlier embargo notice) has already\nbeen given in relation to consumer goods, or product related\nservices, of that kind; and\n\n(b) the embargo period for the earlier embargo notice did not end\nat least 5 days ago."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135u-norm",
