      "values:originalText": "(1) An inspector may apply to a judge of the Federal Court for a\nwarrant in relation to premises.\nIssue of warrant",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An inspector may apply to a judge of the Federal Court for a\nwarrant in relation to premises.\nIssue of warrant",
