      "skos:note": "Inspector may apply for warrant by phone or fax under certain circumstances. An inspector may apply to a judge for a warrant in relation to premises."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-135z-ss-1",
