    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-137g",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "137G Compliance with orders made under section 137F",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-137g"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) an order made under section 137F applies to the person; and\n\n(b) the person contravenes, or refuses or fails to comply with, the\norder.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI\nRemedies  Division 7\n\nSection 137H\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nPenalty:\n\n(a) if the person is a body corporate—900 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is not a body corporate—180 penalty units.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) an order made under section 137F applies to the person; and\n\n(b) the person contravenes, or refuses or fails to comply with, the\norder.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nApplication of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI\nRemedies  Division 7\n\nSection 137H\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nPenalty:\n\n(a) if the person is a body corporate—900 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is not a body corporate—180 penalty units.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-137g-ss-1"
        },
