      "values:originalText": "(5) This section is not to be taken to enable an inferior court of a State\nor a Territory to grant a remedy other than a remedy of a kind that\nthe court is able to grant under the law of that State or Territory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-138b-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
