      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.187",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The court must, if directed to do so by the Federal Court, transfer\nto the Federal Court:\n\n(a) the matter; and\n\n(b) such other matters for determination in the proceeding, the\ndetermination of which would (apart from any law of a State\nor of the Northern Territory relating to cross-vesting of\njurisdiction) be within the jurisdiction of the Federal Court,\nas the Federal Court determines.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The court must, if directed to do so by the Federal Court, transfer\nto the Federal Court:\n\n(a) the matter; and\n\n(b) such other matters for determination in the proceeding, the\ndetermination of which would (apart from any law of a State\nor of the Northern Territory relating to cross-vesting of\njurisdiction) be within the jurisdiction of the Federal Court,\nas the Federal Court determines.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-138d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-138d-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-138d-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7af14a4a86768bf467b54e47dd48f276f3d0548f2e67f755f1321dcc06e36e16",
      "skos:note": "Court must transfer matters to Federal Court upon direction"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-138d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "138D(2) Transfer of matters by a State or Territory court",
