      "cof:title": "139A(2) Terms excluding consumer guarantees from supplies of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 191,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Recreational services are services that consist of participation in:\n\n(a) a sporting activity or a similar leisure time pursuit; or\n\n(b) any other activity that:\n\n(i) involves a significant degree of physical exertion or\nphysical risk; and\n\n(ii) is undertaken for the purposes of recreation, enjoyment\nor leisure."
    },
