    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "139D(3) Enforcement and recovery of certain fines",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-139d-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the court makes an enforcement order, the court may, at any time\nbefore the enforcement order is executed:\n\n(a) allow the person a specified time in which to pay the fine; or\n\n(b) allow the person to pay the fine by specified instalments.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the court makes an enforcement order, the court may, at any time\nbefore the enforcement order is executed:\n\n(a) allow the person a specified time in which to pay the fine; or\n\n(b) allow the person to pay the fine by specified instalments.",
      "values:partOf": {
