    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "139D(4) Enforcement and recovery of certain fines",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-139d-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the court allows the person a specified time in which to pay the\nfine:\n\n(a) the enforcement order must not be executed unless the person\nfails to pay the fine within that time; and\n\n(b) if the person pays the fine within that time—the enforcement\norder is taken to have been discharged.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the court allows the person a specified time in which to pay the\nfine:\n\n(a) the enforcement order must not be executed unless the person\nfails to pay the fine within that time; and\n\n(b) if the person pays the fine within that time—the enforcement\norder is taken to have been discharged.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a13c829e703ed0a5748306008b421d6290e9bcba9953da4dd860a99b4b944823",
      "skos:note": "Court must not execute enforcement order unless person pays fine within specified time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-139d-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "139D(4) Enforcement and recovery of certain fines",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the court allows the person a specified time in which to pay the\nfine:\n\n(a) the enforcement order must not be executed unless the person\nfails to pay the fine within that time; and\n\n(b) if the person pays the fine within that time—the enforcement\norder is taken to have been discharged."
    },
    {
