      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "139D(5) Enforcement and recovery of certain fines",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-139d-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the court allows the person to pay the fine by specified\ninstalments:\n\n(a) the enforcement order must not be executed unless the person\nfails to pay such an instalment at or before the time when it\nbecomes payable; and\n\n(b) if the person pays all those instalments—the enforcement\norder is taken to have been discharged.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the court allows the person to pay the fine by specified\ninstalments:\n\n(a) the enforcement order must not be executed unless the person\nfails to pay such an instalment at or before the time when it\nbecomes payable; and\n\n(b) if the person pays all those instalments—the enforcement\norder is taken to have been discharged.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2b60e0e942a0d5d0ee2c276a978b92383bdea4b58474dff6811b230230d0a86d",
      "skos:note": "Enforcement order discharge upon payment of instalments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-139d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "139D(5) Enforcement and recovery of certain fines",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the court allows the person to pay the fine by specified\ninstalments:\n\n(a) the enforcement order must not be executed unless the person\nfails to pay such an instalment at or before the time when it\nbecomes payable; and\n\n(b) if the person pays all those instalments—the enforcement\norder is taken to have been discharged."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-139d-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
