      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.201",
      "values:originalText": "The object of this Part is to facilitate the application of the\nAustralian Consumer Law by participating States and participating\nTerritories.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions\nPart XIAA  Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of a State or\nTerritory\n\nSection 140B\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "The object of this Part is to facilitate the application of the\nAustralian Consumer Law by participating States and participating\nTerritories.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions\nPart XIAA  Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of a State or\nTerritory\n\nSection 140B\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
