      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "The applied Australian Consumer Law consists of:\n\n(a) Schedule 2; and\n\n(b) the regulations made under section 139G of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "The applied Australian Consumer Law consists of:\n\n(a) Schedule 2; and\n\n(b) the regulations made under section 139G of this Act.",
