    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "150C The Competition Code",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-150c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.207",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Competition Code consists of:\n\n(a) the Schedule version of Part IV;\n\n(b) the remaining provisions of this Act (except sections 2A, 5, 6\nand 172), so far as they would relate to the Schedule version\nif the Schedule version were substituted for Part IV;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Competition Code consists of:\n\n(a) the Schedule version of Part IV;\n\n(b) the remaining provisions of this Act (except sections 2A, 5, 6\nand 172), so far as they would relate to the Schedule version\nif the Schedule version were substituted for Part IV;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d4620a2579831d4778015e59920e3abd549a2506f8f64f612ef0be52bc56f4c7",
      "skos:note": "Defines the Competition Code as consisting of two parts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-150c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "150C The Competition Code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 207,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Competition Code consists of:\n\n(a) the Schedule version of Part IV;\n\n(b) the remaining provisions of this Act (except sections 2A, 5, 6\nand 172), so far as they would relate to the Schedule version\nif the Schedule version were substituted for Part IV;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
