    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150j",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "150J Authorisations etc. under this Act may relate also to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-150j"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.212",
      "values:originalText": "Competition Code\n\nThe validity of an authorisation, notification, determination or any\nother thing given or done for the purposes of this Act is not\naffected only because it was given or done also for the purposes of\nthe Competition Code.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nThe Competition Code  Part XIA\n\nSection 150K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "Competition Code\n\nThe validity of an authorisation, notification, determination or any\nother thing given or done for the purposes of this Act is not\naffected only because it was given or done also for the purposes of\nthe Competition Code.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nThe Competition Code  Part XIA\n\nSection 150K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150j-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150j-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da06a73b1f645f562c5280e8c2ac0f6222f270f17584b6a49817b1966ddfabd3",
      "skos:note": "The validity of an authorisation is not affected by its relation to the Competition Code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-150j",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "150J Authorisations etc. under this Act may relate also to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 212,
      "values:originalText": "Competition Code\n\nThe validity of an authorisation, notification, determination or any\nother thing given or done for the purposes of this Act is not\naffected only because it was given or done also for the purposes of\nthe Competition Code.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nThe Competition Code  Part XIA\n\nSection 150K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
