      "values:originalText": "(1) Without prejudice to its effect apart from this section, this Part also\nhas effect as provided by this section.\n\n(2) This Part has, by force of this subsection, the effect it would have\nif:\n\n(a) any references in this Part to a carrier were, by express\nprovision, confined to a carrier that is a corporation; and\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Without prejudice to its effect apart from this section, this Part also\nhas effect as provided by this section.\n\n(2) This Part has, by force of this subsection, the effect it would have\nif:\n\n(a) any references in this Part to a carrier were, by express\nprovision, confined to a carrier that is a corporation; and\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
