    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151af",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151AF Telecommunications market",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151af"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, a telecommunications market is a\nmarket in which any of the following goods or services are\nsupplied or acquired:\n\n(a) carriage services;\n\n(b) goods or services for use in connection with a carriage\nservice;\n\n(c) access to facilities;\n\n(d) content services.\nNote:\nMarket has a meaning affected by section 4E.\n151AG  When a body corporate is related to a partnership\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a carrier or a carriage service provider is a partnership; and\n\n(b) a body corporate is related to a partner in the partnership;\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Part, a telecommunications market is a\nmarket in which any of the following goods or services are\nsupplied or acquired:\n\n(a) carriage services;\n\n(b) goods or services for use in connection with a carriage\nservice;\n\n(c) access to facilities;\n\n(d) content services.\nNote:\nMarket has a meaning affected by section 4E.\n151AG  When a body corporate is related to a partnership\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a carrier or a carriage service provider is a partnership; and\n\n(b) a body corporate is related to a partner in the partnership;\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151af-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "564f149983ebcee74855307161df53601efad5e9a7a50c51e2d8395a1e0e771c",
      "skos:note": "Defines telecommunications market for purposes of Part"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151af",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151AF Telecommunications market",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, a telecommunications market is a\nmarket in which any of the following goods or services are\nsupplied or acquired:\n\n(a) carriage services;\n\n(b) goods or services for use in connection with a carriage\nservice;\n\n(c) access to facilities;\n\n(d) content services.\nNote:\nMarket has a meaning affected by section 4E.\n151AG  When a body corporate is related to a partnership\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a carrier or a carriage service provider is a partnership; and\n\n(b) a body corporate is related to a partner in the partnership;\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151af-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151af"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151AH Degree of power in a telecommunications market",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151ah"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate has a substantial degree of power in a\ntelecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more bodies corporate are related to the one:\n\n(i) carrier; or\n\n(ii) carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) those bodies corporate together have a substantial degree of\npower in a telecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate and the carrier or carriage service\nprovider, as the case may be, together have a substantial\ndegree of power in a telecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(4) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more bodies corporate are related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate has a substantial degree of power in a\ntelecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more bodies corporate are related to the one:\n\n(i) carrier; or\n\n(ii) carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) those bodies corporate together have a substantial degree of\npower in a telecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate and the carrier or carriage service\nprovider, as the case may be, together have a substantial\ndegree of power in a telecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(4) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more bodies corporate are related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d06064911299ff3f8f065180df6b094c51d1f06dc1231f8b1f3a8f83cd40906f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151ah",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151AH Degree of power in a telecommunications market",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate has a substantial degree of power in a\ntelecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more bodies corporate are related to the one:\n\n(i) carrier; or\n\n(ii) carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) those bodies corporate together have a substantial degree of\npower in a telecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate and the carrier or carriage service\nprovider, as the case may be, together have a substantial\ndegree of power in a telecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.\n\n(4) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) 2 or more bodies corporate are related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151AH(1) Degree of power in a telecommunications market",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151ah-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate has a substantial degree of power in a\ntelecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate has a substantial degree of power in a\ntelecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ah-ss-1-logic-linearlogic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "49a7770836f037d4af445d97d182ace16b1fb2a279d666ce208b47c5f12a15f5",
      "skos:note": "A body corporate with substantial power in a telecommunications market is taken to have that power if it is related to a carrier or carriage service provider."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151ah-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151AH(1) Degree of power in a telecommunications market",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a body corporate is related to:\n\n(i) a carrier; or\n\n(ii) a carriage service provider; and\n\n(b) the body corporate has a substantial degree of power in a\ntelecommunications market;\nthe carrier or carriage service provider, as the case requires, is\ntaken to have a substantial degree of power in that market."
    },
