      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.225",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A carrier or carriage service provider must not engage in\nanti-competitive conduct.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, the rule set out in subsection (1) is to\nbe known as the competition rule.\nNote:\nFor enforcement of the competition rule, see Division 7.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A carrier or carriage service provider must not engage in\nanti-competitive conduct.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, the rule set out in subsection (1) is to\nbe known as the competition rule.\nNote:\nFor enforcement of the competition rule, see Division 7.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
