      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, the rule set out in subsection (1) is to\nbe known as the competition rule.\nNote:\nFor enforcement of the competition rule, see Division 7.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, the rule set out in subsection (1) is to\nbe known as the competition rule.\nNote:\nFor enforcement of the competition rule, see Division 7.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
