    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151AN Evidentiary effect of competition notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151an"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.228",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In any proceedings under, or arising out of, this Part, a Part B\ncompetition notice is prima facie evidence of the matters in the\nnotice.\n\n(2) A document purporting to be a competition notice must, unless the\ncontrary is established, be taken to be a competition notice and to\nhave been properly issued.\n\n(3) The Commission may certify that a document is a copy of a\ncompetition notice.\n\n(4) This section applies to the certified copy as if it were the original.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In any proceedings under, or arising out of, this Part, a Part B\ncompetition notice is prima facie evidence of the matters in the\nnotice.\n\n(2) A document purporting to be a competition notice must, unless the\ncontrary is established, be taken to be a competition notice and to\nhave been properly issued.\n\n(3) The Commission may certify that a document is a copy of a\ncompetition notice.\n\n(4) This section applies to the certified copy as if it were the original.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "256f56f5541ed3a578e353f13f1a737319982a8d342c2fbf90e79bc1431f286d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151an",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151AN Evidentiary effect of competition notice",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 228,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In any proceedings under, or arising out of, this Part, a Part B\ncompetition notice is prima facie evidence of the matters in the\nnotice.\n\n(2) A document purporting to be a competition notice must, unless the\ncontrary is established, be taken to be a competition notice and to\nhave been properly issued.\n\n(3) The Commission may certify that a document is a copy of a\ncompetition notice.\n\n(4) This section applies to the certified copy as if it were the original."
    },
