      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.233",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An exemption order is not invalid only because the conduct\nspecified in the order is conduct of a kind that, apart from the\norder, is outside the scope of section 151AJ (which deals with\nanti-competitive conduct).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An exemption order is not invalid only because the conduct\nspecified in the order is conduct of a kind that, apart from the\norder, is outside the scope of section 151AJ (which deals with\nanti-competitive conduct).",
