      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151AT Form of application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 233,
      "values:originalText": "An application for an exemption order must be:\n\n(a) in writing; and\n\n(b) in a form approved in writing by the Commission; and\n\n(c) accompanied by the prescribed fee.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
