    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ax",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151AX Commission may refuse to consider application if it relates to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151ax"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.234",
      "values:originalText": "the same conduct as an authorisation application\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for\nan exemption order; and\n\n(b) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for\nan authorisation under Division 1 of Part VII; and\n\n(c) the application for the exemption order and the application\nfor the authorisation relate to the same conduct.\n\n(2) The Commission may refuse to:\n\n(a) consider the application for the exemption order; or\n\n(b) convene a conference under section 151AZ to discuss the\napplication for the exemption order;\nuntil:\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "skos:definition": "the same conduct as an authorisation application\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for\nan exemption order; and\n\n(b) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for\nan authorisation under Division 1 of Part VII; and\n\n(c) the application for the exemption order and the application\nfor the authorisation relate to the same conduct.\n\n(2) The Commission may refuse to:\n\n(a) consider the application for the exemption order; or\n\n(b) convene a conference under section 151AZ to discuss the\napplication for the exemption order;\nuntil:\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
