      "cml:premiseText": "until:\n\n(c) the Commission decides whether or not to give a notice under subsection 93(3) or (3A) or 93AC(1) or (2);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ay-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4",
