        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.239",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission must keep a Register in relation to exemption\norders.\n\n(2) The Register must include the following:\n\n(a) particulars of all exemption orders (including orders that\nhave expired);\n\n(b) applications for exemption orders received by the\nCommission (including applications that have been\nwithdrawn);\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission must keep a Register in relation to exemption\norders.\n\n(2) The Register must include the following:\n\n(a) particulars of all exemption orders (including orders that\nhave expired);\n\n(b) applications for exemption orders received by the\nCommission (including applications that have been\nwithdrawn);\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
