    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151BU Commission may make record-keeping rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bu"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.241",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission may, by written instrument, make rules for and in\nrelation to requiring one or more specified carriers or one or more\nspecified carriage service providers to keep and retain records.\nRules under this subsection may also require those carriers or\ncarriage service providers to prepare reports consisting of\ninformation contained in those records. Rules under this subsection\nmay also require those carriers or carriage service providers to give\nany or all of the reports to the Commission. Rules under this\nsubsection are to be known as record-keeping rules.\nNote 1:\nCarriers and carriage service providers may be specified by name, by\ninclusion in a specified class or in any other way.\nNote 2:\nFor enforcement of the record-keeping rules, see Division 7.\n\n(2) The rules may specify the manner and form in which the records\nare to be kept.\n\n(2A) The rules may specify the manner and form in which reports are to\nbe prepared.\n\n(2B) The rules may provide for:\n\n(a) the preparation of reports as and when required by the\nCommission; or\n\n(b) the preparation of periodic reports relating to such regular\nintervals as are specified in the rules.\n\n(2C) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance\nwith the rules to be given to the Commission, in accordance with\nspecified software requirements and specified authentication\nrequirements:\n\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\n\n(2D) Subsections (2), (2A), (2B) and (2C) do not limit subsection (1).\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission may, by written instrument, make rules for and in\nrelation to requiring one or more specified carriers or one or more\nspecified carriage service providers to keep and retain records.\nRules under this subsection may also require those carriers or\ncarriage service providers to prepare reports consisting of\ninformation contained in those records. Rules under this subsection\nmay also require those carriers or carriage service providers to give\nany or all of the reports to the Commission. Rules under this\nsubsection are to be known as record-keeping rules.\nNote 1:\nCarriers and carriage service providers may be specified by name, by\ninclusion in a specified class or in any other way.\nNote 2:\nFor enforcement of the record-keeping rules, see Division 7.\n\n(2) The rules may specify the manner and form in which the records\nare to be kept.\n\n(2A) The rules may specify the manner and form in which reports are to\nbe prepared.\n\n(2B) The rules may provide for:\n\n(a) the preparation of reports as and when required by the\nCommission; or\n\n(b) the preparation of periodic reports relating to such regular\nintervals as are specified in the rules.\n\n(2C) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance\nwith the rules to be given to the Commission, in accordance with\nspecified software requirements and specified authentication\nrequirements:\n\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\n\n(2D) Subsections (2), (2A), (2B) and (2C) do not limit subsection (1).\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu-ss-2a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu-ss-2b"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu-ss-2c"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bu-ss-2d"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6888df2cedb9de434d951ee554fa5395a09c5ee519da52bfaeb48abb2a85102e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bu",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151BU Commission may make record-keeping rules",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 241,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission may, by written instrument, make rules for and in\nrelation to requiring one or more specified carriers or one or more\nspecified carriage service providers to keep and retain records.\nRules under this subsection may also require those carriers or\ncarriage service providers to prepare reports consisting of\ninformation contained in those records. Rules under this subsection\nmay also require those carriers or carriage service providers to give\nany or all of the reports to the Commission. Rules under this\nsubsection are to be known as record-keeping rules.\nNote 1:\nCarriers and carriage service providers may be specified by name, by\ninclusion in a specified class or in any other way.\nNote 2:\nFor enforcement of the record-keeping rules, see Division 7.\n\n(2) The rules may specify the manner and form in which the records\nare to be kept.\n\n(2A) The rules may specify the manner and form in which reports are to\nbe prepared.\n\n(2B) The rules may provide for:\n\n(a) the preparation of reports as and when required by the\nCommission; or\n\n(b) the preparation of periodic reports relating to such regular\nintervals as are specified in the rules.\n\n(2C) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance\nwith the rules to be given to the Commission, in accordance with\nspecified software requirements and specified authentication\nrequirements:\n\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\n\n(2D) Subsections (2), (2A), (2B) and (2C) do not limit subsection (1).\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
    {
