      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.264",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person must not, in purported compliance with a requirement\nimposed by the record-keeping rules, make a record of any matter\nor thing in such a way that it does not correctly record the matter or\nthing.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person must not, in purported compliance with a requirement\nimposed by the record-keeping rules, make a record of any matter\nor thing in such a way that it does not correctly record the matter or\nthing.",
