    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151BW Person involved in a contravention of the competition rule, a",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bw"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.265",
      "values:originalText": "record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction\n\nA reference in this Division to a person involved in a contravention\nof the competition rule, a record-keeping rule or a disclosure\ndirection is a reference to a person who:\n\n(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention;\nor\n\n(b) has induced, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, the\ncontravention; or\n\n(c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention; or\n\n(d) has conspired with others to effect the contravention.",
      "skos:definition": "record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction\n\nA reference in this Division to a person involved in a contravention\nof the competition rule, a record-keeping rule or a disclosure\ndirection is a reference to a person who:\n\n(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention;\nor\n\n(b) has induced, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, the\ncontravention; or\n\n(c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention; or\n\n(d) has conspired with others to effect the contravention.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-argumentation-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e1a9de386af88550f7e5b19bf43d4d112fa0a01e5325cc6d3ebec955ab369d3b",
      "skos:note": "Defines who is considered involved in a contravention of the competition rule."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bw",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151BW Person involved in a contravention of the competition rule, a",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 265,
      "values:originalText": "record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction\n\nA reference in this Division to a person involved in a contravention\nof the competition rule, a record-keeping rule or a disclosure\ndirection is a reference to a person who:\n\n(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention;\nor\n\n(b) has induced, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, the\ncontravention; or\n\n(c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention; or\n\n(d) has conspired with others to effect the contravention."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is-a",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Classification as involved in a contravention",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Person involved in a contravention of the competition rule, a",
      "cml:conclusionText": "has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention; or has induced, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, the contravention; or has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, the contravention;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relation between a person and a contravention",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention; or has induced, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, the contravention;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the contravention occurred during this period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relation between a person and a contravention",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, the contravention;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the contravention occurred until this period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "through",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Transmission of a contravention through a person",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "has conspired with others to effect the contravention;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the contravention was transmitted through this person"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bw-logic-argumentation-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implication of a person's involvement in a contravention",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention; (b) has induced, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, the contravention;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the person is involved in the contravention"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bx",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151BX Pecuniary penalties for breach of the competition rule, a",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bx"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.265",
      "values:originalText": "record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction\n\n(1) If the Federal Court is satisfied that a person:\n\n(a) has contravened the competition rule, a record-keeping rule\nor a disclosure direction; or\n\n(b) has attempted to contravene the competition rule, a\nrecord-keeping rule or a disclosure direction; or\n\n(c) has been involved in a contravention of the competition rule,\na record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction;\nthe Court may order the person to pay to the Commonwealth such\npecuniary penalty, in respect of each contravention, as the Court\ndetermines to be appropriate.\n\n(2) In determining a pecuniary penalty, the Court must have regard to\nall relevant matters, including:\n\n(a) the nature and extent of the contravention; and\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction\n\n(1) If the Federal Court is satisfied that a person:\n\n(a) has contravened the competition rule, a record-keeping rule\nor a disclosure direction; or\n\n(b) has attempted to contravene the competition rule, a\nrecord-keeping rule or a disclosure direction; or\n\n(c) has been involved in a contravention of the competition rule,\na record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction;\nthe Court may order the person to pay to the Commonwealth such\npecuniary penalty, in respect of each contravention, as the Court\ndetermines to be appropriate.\n\n(2) In determining a pecuniary penalty, the Court must have regard to\nall relevant matters, including:\n\n(a) the nature and extent of the contravention; and\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bx-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bx-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e83a91b18047390c6cb2c7b9d4123e08e895f569f1258cf77177debe10edc98d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bx",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151BX Pecuniary penalties for breach of the competition rule, a",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 265,
      "values:originalText": "record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction\n\n(1) If the Federal Court is satisfied that a person:\n\n(a) has contravened the competition rule, a record-keeping rule\nor a disclosure direction; or\n\n(b) has attempted to contravene the competition rule, a\nrecord-keeping rule or a disclosure direction; or\n\n(c) has been involved in a contravention of the competition rule,\na record-keeping rule or a disclosure direction;\nthe Court may order the person to pay to the Commonwealth such\npecuniary penalty, in respect of each contravention, as the Court\ndetermines to be appropriate.\n\n(2) In determining a pecuniary penalty, the Court must have regard to\nall relevant matters, including:\n\n(a) the nature and extent of the contravention; and\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
    {
