      "skos:note": "Proceedings for certain offences cannot be brought under subsection (1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151bz-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151BZ(3) Criminal proceedings not to be brought for contraventions of",
