    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151CD Finding of fact in proceedings to be evidence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151cd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.272",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a finding of any fact by a court made in\nproceedings under section 151BY, 151CA or 151CB in which a\nperson has been found to have contravened, or to have been\ninvolved in a contravention of, the competition rule.\n\n(2) In:\n\n(a) a proceeding under section 151CC against the person; or\n\n(b) an application under subsection 151CE(1) for an order\nagainst the person;\nthe finding:\n\n(c) is prima facie evidence of that fact; and\n\n(d) may be proved by production of a document under the seal of\nthe court from which the finding appears.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a finding of any fact by a court made in\nproceedings under section 151BY, 151CA or 151CB in which a\nperson has been found to have contravened, or to have been\ninvolved in a contravention of, the competition rule.\n\n(2) In:\n\n(a) a proceeding under section 151CC against the person; or\n\n(b) an application under subsection 151CE(1) for an order\nagainst the person;\nthe finding:\n\n(c) is prima facie evidence of that fact; and\n\n(d) may be proved by production of a document under the seal of\nthe court from which the finding appears.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cd-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cd-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0f2d9c2b88f84f7053bc55028ad3bf8b558b806835565f1c6156a196e0c005b7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151cd",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151CD Finding of fact in proceedings to be evidence",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 272,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a finding of any fact by a court made in\nproceedings under section 151BY, 151CA or 151CB in which a\nperson has been found to have contravened, or to have been\ninvolved in a contravention of, the competition rule.\n\n(2) In:\n\n(a) a proceeding under section 151CC against the person; or\n\n(b) an application under subsection 151CE(1) for an order\nagainst the person;\nthe finding:\n\n(c) is prima facie evidence of that fact; and\n\n(d) may be proved by production of a document under the seal of\nthe court from which the finding appears."
    },
