      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.274",
      "values:originalText": "Part 32 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 applies in relation to\nproceedings under this Division in a corresponding way to the way\nin which it applies to proceedings under that Act (as defined by\nsection 574 of that Act).\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "skos:definition": "Part 32 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 applies in relation to\nproceedings under this Division in a corresponding way to the way\nin which it applies to proceedings under that Act (as defined by\nsection 574 of that Act).\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "cml:asserts": [
