      "cof:title": "151CG(4) Disclosure of documents by Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 275,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Federal Court may refuse to make an order under\nsubsection (3) about a document or a part of a document if the\nFederal Court considers it inappropriate to make the order on the\ngrounds that the disclosure of the contents of the document or part\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
