      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.278",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An application under this section for a review of a decision must\nbe:\n\n(a) in writing; and\n\n(b) in the case of an application under subsection (1) or (2)—\nmade within 21 days after the Commission made the\ndecision; and\n\n(c) in the case of an application under subsection (3)—made\nwithin 7 days after the Commission made the decision; and\n\n(d) in the case of an application under subsection (3A)—made\nwithin 28 days after the Commission made the decision.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An application under this section for a review of a decision must\nbe:\n\n(a) in writing; and\n\n(b) in the case of an application under subsection (1) or (2)—\nmade within 21 days after the Commission made the\ndecision; and\n\n(c) in the case of an application under subsection (3)—made\nwithin 7 days after the Commission made the decision; and\n\n(d) in the case of an application under subsection (3A)—made\nwithin 28 days after the Commission made the decision.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-4-logic-linearlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-4-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ec51a2b027063ab426dfc52ab57f8c8a3855711c1eca8422f98f3a78f4d4ed82",
      "skos:note": "Application requirements for review of a decision",
      "dc:description": "written application within specified timeframes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151ci-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151CI(4) Review by Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 278,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An application under this section for a review of a decision must\nbe:\n\n(a) in writing; and\n\n(b) in the case of an application under subsection (1) or (2)—\nmade within 21 days after the Commission made the\ndecision; and\n\n(c) in the case of an application under subsection (3)—made\nwithin 7 days after the Commission made the decision; and\n\n(d) in the case of an application under subsection (3A)—made\nwithin 28 days after the Commission made the decision."
    },
