      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.278",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a\nreview of a decision, the Tribunal must review the decision.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
