    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cj-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151CJ(3) Functions and powers of Tribunal",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151cj-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.279",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of a review by the Tribunal, the member of the\nTribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission to\ngive such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of a review by the Tribunal, the member of the\nTribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission to\ngive such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cj"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cj-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cj-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e96bb81457a5a66f9f8d561feaf922830d1718309b71ead76a56a1f91b0fb5fe",
      "skos:note": "Commission must provide information, reports, and assistance to the Tribunal as specified by a member.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151cj-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151CJ(3) Functions and powers of Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 279,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of a review by the Tribunal, the member of the\nTribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission to\ngive such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
