    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cm",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151CM Monitoring of telecommunications charges paid by",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151cm"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.282",
      "values:originalText": "consumers\n\n(1) The Commission must monitor, and report each financial year on,\ncharges paid by consumers in telecommunications markets.\n\n(2) The Commission may decide which charges to monitor and report\non, having regard to which goods or services are most commonly\nused by consumers.\n\n(3) The Commission must publish the report on its website as soon as\npracticable and no later than 6 months after the end of the financial\nyear concerned.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "skos:definition": "consumers\n\n(1) The Commission must monitor, and report each financial year on,\ncharges paid by consumers in telecommunications markets.\n\n(2) The Commission may decide which charges to monitor and report\non, having regard to which goods or services are most commonly\nused by consumers.\n\n(3) The Commission must publish the report on its website as soon as\npracticable and no later than 6 months after the end of the financial\nyear concerned.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cm-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cm-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cm-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2a49fdd64f2ae219b4e46fe5f730ff82774fa4345132e09feb501d91f05cb783"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151cm",
