    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151da",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151DA Authorised conduct—subsection 51(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151da"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.288",
      "values:originalText": "Objects\n\n(1) The objects of this section are:\n\n(a) to promote the national interest in structural reform of the\ntelecommunications industry; and\n\n(b) to promote uniform national pricing of eligible services\nsupplied by NBN corporations by authorising, for the\npurposes of subsection 51(1), certain conduct engaged in by\nNBN corporations.\nNote 1:\nIf conduct is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1), the\nconduct is disregarded in deciding whether a person has contravened",
      "skos:definition": "Objects\n\n(1) The objects of this section are:\n\n(a) to promote the national interest in structural reform of the\ntelecommunications industry; and\n\n(b) to promote uniform national pricing of eligible services\nsupplied by NBN corporations by authorising, for the\npurposes of subsection 51(1), certain conduct engaged in by\nNBN corporations.\nNote 1:\nIf conduct is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1), the\nconduct is disregarded in deciding whether a person has contravened",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151da-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151da-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6406805bd9f4f8b5b4f0b09ebe2279b986e96b264858336e7b7d0af9f6f7a10a",
      "skos:note": "Authorise conduct for promoting national interest and uniform pricing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151da",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151DA Authorised conduct—subsection 51(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 288,
      "values:originalText": "Objects\n\n(1) The objects of this section are:\n\n(a) to promote the national interest in structural reform of the\ntelecommunications industry; and\n\n(b) to promote uniform national pricing of eligible services\nsupplied by NBN corporations by authorising, for the\npurposes of subsection 51(1), certain conduct engaged in by\nNBN corporations.\nNote 1:\nIf conduct is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1), the\nconduct is disregarded in deciding whether a person has contravened"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151da-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151da"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151da-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "authorise",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Grant permission",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Objects are authorised to promote national interest and uniform pricing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151db",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151DB Listed points of interconnection",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-151db"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.293",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission:\n\n(a) must prepare a written list setting out points of\ninterconnection; and\n\n(b) may, by writing, vary that list.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, a point of interconnection\nspecified in a list in force under subsection (1) is a listed point of\ninterconnection.\n\n(3) The Commission must publish on its website a copy of a list in\nforce under subsection (1).\n\n(4) A list under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(5) A variation of a list under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission:\n\n(a) must prepare a written list setting out points of\ninterconnection; and\n\n(b) may, by writing, vary that list.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, a point of interconnection\nspecified in a list in force under subsection (1) is a listed point of\ninterconnection.\n\n(3) The Commission must publish on its website a copy of a list in\nforce under subsection (1).\n\n(4) A list under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(5) A variation of a list under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151db-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151db-ss-2"
        },
