      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.296",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (4) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which\nregard may be had.\nEncouraging efficient use of infrastructure etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsection (4) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which\nregard may be had.\nEncouraging efficient use of infrastructure etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
