    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ab-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AB(5) Object of this Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 296,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (4) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which\nregard may be had.\nEncouraging efficient use of infrastructure etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ab-ss-5-norm",
