    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152af-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152AF(3) Access",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152af-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.302",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Part, if an access determination imposes a\nrequirement on a carrier or carriage service provider as mentioned\nin paragraph 152BC(3)(e), anything done by the carrier or provider\nin fulfilment of the requirement is taken to be an aspect of access\nto a declared service.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this Part, if an access determination imposes a\nrequirement on a carrier or carriage service provider as mentioned\nin paragraph 152BC(3)(e), anything done by the carrier or provider\nin fulfilment of the requirement is taken to be an aspect of access\nto a declared service.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152af"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152af-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152af-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "67b4d62e28b01166042d271de7629ae5a0807867f290156de3ca127496e8ad39",
      "skos:note": "Anything done by a carrier or provider in fulfillment of the requirement is taken to be an aspect of access to a declared service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152af-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AF(3) Access",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 302,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Part, if an access determination imposes a\nrequirement on a carrier or carriage service provider as mentioned\nin paragraph 152BC(3)(e), anything done by the carrier or provider\nin fulfilment of the requirement is taken to be an aspect of access\nto a declared service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152af-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
