      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152al-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152AL(3) Declared services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152al-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.305",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission may, by written instrument, declare that a\nspecified eligible service is a declared service if:\n\n(a) the Commission has held a public inquiry under Part 25 of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to make\nthe declaration; and\n\n(b) the Commission has prepared a report about the inquiry\nunder section 505 of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and\n\n(c) the report was published during the 180-day period ending\nwhen the declaration was made; and\n\n(d) the Commission is satisfied that the making of the\ndeclaration will promote the long-term interests of end-users\nof carriage services or of services provided by means of\ncarriage services.\nNote:\nEligible services may be specified by name, by inclusion in a specified\nclass or in any other way.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commission may, by written instrument, declare that a\nspecified eligible service is a declared service if:\n\n(a) the Commission has held a public inquiry under Part 25 of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to make\nthe declaration; and\n\n(b) the Commission has prepared a report about the inquiry\nunder section 505 of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and\n\n(c) the report was published during the 180-day period ending\nwhen the declaration was made; and\n\n(d) the Commission is satisfied that the making of the\ndeclaration will promote the long-term interests of end-users\nof carriage services or of services provided by means of\ncarriage services.\nNote:\nEligible services may be specified by name, by inclusion in a specified\nclass or in any other way.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152al"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152al-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ee5229b87c12ffd31d7d19f7a224cff048f6c4ff2548192e5085ec30c0b3899a",
      "skos:note": "Commission may declare a specified eligible service as a declared service under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152al-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AL(3) Declared services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 305,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission may, by written instrument, declare that a\nspecified eligible service is a declared service if:\n\n(a) the Commission has held a public inquiry under Part 25 of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to make\nthe declaration; and\n\n(b) the Commission has prepared a report about the inquiry\nunder section 505 of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and\n\n(c) the report was published during the 180-day period ending\nwhen the declaration was made; and\n\n(d) the Commission is satisfied that the making of the\ndeclaration will promote the long-term interests of end-users\nof carriage services or of services provided by means of\ncarriage services.\nNote:\nEligible services may be specified by name, by inclusion in a specified\nclass or in any other way."
    },
