    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152al-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AL(3A) Declared services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 305,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) A declaration under subsection (3) does not apply to an eligible\nservice to the extent to which the service is supplied, or is capable\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
