    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152am",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152AM Inquiries about proposals to declare services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152am"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.313",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a public inquiry of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph 152AL(3)(a) or (8A)(a) or 152ALA(7)(a).\n\n(2) The Commission may hold the inquiry:\n\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n\n(b) if requested in writing to do so by a person.\n\n(3) The Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to hold\na public inquiry of a kind mentioned in paragraph 152AL(3)(a) or\n(8A)(a) if the Commission is requested to do so by a person.\n\n(4) The Commission must give the ACMA a copy of the report about\nthe inquiry prepared in accordance with section 505 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997.\n\n(5) If the inquiry is held at the request of a person, the Commission\nmust give the person a copy of the report about the inquiry\nprepared under section 505 of the Telecommunications Act 1997.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a public inquiry of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph 152AL(3)(a) or (8A)(a) or 152ALA(7)(a).\n\n(2) The Commission may hold the inquiry:\n\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n\n(b) if requested in writing to do so by a person.\n\n(3) The Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to hold\na public inquiry of a kind mentioned in paragraph 152AL(3)(a) or\n(8A)(a) if the Commission is requested to do so by a person.\n\n(4) The Commission must give the ACMA a copy of the report about\nthe inquiry prepared in accordance with section 505 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997.\n\n(5) If the inquiry is held at the request of a person, the Commission\nmust give the person a copy of the report about the inquiry\nprepared under section 505 of the Telecommunications Act 1997.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152am-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152am-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152am-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152am-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152am-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c68d7820b86e3da8ae0bcb13c13bd6ba5a26bb95cadec652b5f426a70026a77f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152am",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AM Inquiries about proposals to declare services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 313,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a public inquiry of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph 152AL(3)(a) or (8A)(a) or 152ALA(7)(a).\n\n(2) The Commission may hold the inquiry:\n\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n\n(b) if requested in writing to do so by a person.\n\n(3) The Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to hold\na public inquiry of a kind mentioned in paragraph 152AL(3)(a) or\n(8A)(a) if the Commission is requested to do so by a person.\n\n(4) The Commission must give the ACMA a copy of the report about\nthe inquiry prepared in accordance with section 505 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997.\n\n(5) If the inquiry is held at the request of a person, the Commission\nmust give the person a copy of the report about the inquiry\nprepared under section 505 of the Telecommunications Act 1997."
    },
