    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ao-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AO(3) Variation or revocation of declaration",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 314,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a variation of a declaration under subsection 152AL(3) or (8A) is\na variation that, under the Procedural Rules, is taken to be a\nvariation of a minor nature, the Commission is not required to hold\na public inquiry under Part 25 of the Telecommunications Act 1997\nabout the proposed variation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ao-ss-3-norm",
