          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152aq-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b973e12212a1f931da83fa98c7c1c64121f1e1bc85afa6530167b1e364cb24d9",
      "skos:note": "Register of declared services must include certain particulars. Person may institute proceedings for recovery of compensation from Commonwealth if agreement on amount cannot be reached."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152aq-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AQ(2) Register of declared services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 314,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Register must include the following:\n\n(a) particulars of all such declarations (including declarations\nthat have been revoked);\n\n(b) particulars of variations and revocations of such declarations;\n\n(c) copies of reports prepared in accordance with section 505 of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1997 in relation to inquiries\nmentioned in paragraph 152AL(3)(a) or (8A)(a) or\n152ALA(7)(a) of this Act."
    },
