    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152aq-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AQ(1) Register of declared services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 314,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the operation of any or all of the following provisions:\n\n(a) subsection 152AL(9), (10), (11), (12), (13) or (14);\n\n(b) subsection 152ALA(10), (11), (12) or (13);\nwould result in an acquisition of property from a person otherwise\nthan on just terms, the Commonwealth is liable to pay a reasonable\namount of compensation to the person."
    },
