    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ar-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152AR(2) Category A standard access obligations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ar-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.316",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, if a carrier (other than an NBN\ncorporation) or a carriage service provider (other than an NBN\ncorporation) supplies declared services, whether to itself or to other\npersons:\n\n(a) the carrier or provider is an access provider; and\n\n(b) the declared services are active declared services.\nSupply of active declared service to service provider",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this section, if a carrier (other than an NBN\ncorporation) or a carriage service provider (other than an NBN\ncorporation) supplies declared services, whether to itself or to other\npersons:\n\n(a) the carrier or provider is an access provider; and\n\n(b) the declared services are active declared services.\nSupply of active declared service to service provider",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ar"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ar-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ar-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bd76b8477def0562e8a0ae31fd35cdf59e8331c62a4c853ca7fa04d07fa691ff",
      "skos:note": "Carrier or provider must be an access provider and supply active declared services.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ar-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AR(2) Category A standard access obligations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 316,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, if a carrier (other than an NBN\ncorporation) or a carriage service provider (other than an NBN\ncorporation) supplies declared services, whether to itself or to other\npersons:\n\n(a) the carrier or provider is an access provider; and\n\n(b) the declared services are active declared services.\nSupply of active declared service to service provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ar-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
