      "skos:note": "Regulations may provide that a specified act is taken to be ordering."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ar-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AR(4B) Category A standard access obligations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 316,
      "values:originalText": "(4B) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of\nsubsection (4A), a specified act or thing is taken to be ordering.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
