      "cof:title": "152AU(3) Individual exemptions—request for further information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 327,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Procedural Rules do not make provision for or in relation to a\ntime limit for giving the information, the Commission may refuse\nto consider the application until the applicant gives the\nCommission the information."
    },
