    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ay",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152AY Compliance with standard access obligations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ay"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.333",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a carrier or carriage service provider is\nrequired to comply with any or all of the standard access\nobligations.\n\n(2) The carrier or carriage service provider must comply with the\nobligations:\n\n(a) if an access agreement between:\n\n(i) the carrier or carriage service provider, as the case\nrequires; and\n\n(ii) the access seeker;\n\nis in operation and specifies terms and conditions about a\nparticular matter—on such terms and conditions relating to\nthat matter as are set out in the agreement; or\n\n(b) if:\n\n(i) paragraph (a) does not apply in relation to terms and\nconditions about a particular matter; and\n\n(ii) a special access undertaking given by the carrier or\ncarriage service provider is in operation, and the\nundertaking specifies terms and conditions about that\nmatter—on such terms and conditions relating to that\nmatter as are set out in the undertaking; or\n\n(c) if:\n\n(i) neither paragraph (a) nor (b) applies to terms and\nconditions about a particular matter; and\n\n(ii) binding rules of conduct specify terms and conditions\nabout that matter;\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a carrier or carriage service provider is\nrequired to comply with any or all of the standard access\nobligations.\n\n(2) The carrier or carriage service provider must comply with the\nobligations:\n\n(a) if an access agreement between:\n\n(i) the carrier or carriage service provider, as the case\nrequires; and\n\n(ii) the access seeker;\n\nis in operation and specifies terms and conditions about a\nparticular matter—on such terms and conditions relating to\nthat matter as are set out in the agreement; or\n\n(b) if:\n\n(i) paragraph (a) does not apply in relation to terms and\nconditions about a particular matter; and\n\n(ii) a special access undertaking given by the carrier or\ncarriage service provider is in operation, and the\nundertaking specifies terms and conditions about that\nmatter—on such terms and conditions relating to that\nmatter as are set out in the undertaking; or\n\n(c) if:\n\n(i) neither paragraph (a) nor (b) applies to terms and\nconditions about a particular matter; and\n\n(ii) binding rules of conduct specify terms and conditions\nabout that matter;\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ay-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ay-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1388594ec51058c4ff9ef8cefdd7b3f9d989ccf47d746a4991a4b4f591af4b1a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ay",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152AY Compliance with standard access obligations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 333,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a carrier or carriage service provider is\nrequired to comply with any or all of the standard access\nobligations.\n\n(2) The carrier or carriage service provider must comply with the\nobligations:\n\n(a) if an access agreement between:\n\n(i) the carrier or carriage service provider, as the case\nrequires; and\n\n(ii) the access seeker;\n\nis in operation and specifies terms and conditions about a\nparticular matter—on such terms and conditions relating to\nthat matter as are set out in the agreement; or\n\n(b) if:\n\n(i) paragraph (a) does not apply in relation to terms and\nconditions about a particular matter; and\n\n(ii) a special access undertaking given by the carrier or\ncarriage service provider is in operation, and the\nundertaking specifies terms and conditions about that\nmatter—on such terms and conditions relating to that\nmatter as are set out in the undertaking; or\n\n(c) if:\n\n(i) neither paragraph (a) nor (b) applies to terms and\nconditions about a particular matter; and\n\n(ii) binding rules of conduct specify terms and conditions\nabout that matter;\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
