    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ba",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152BA Service provider rule",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ba"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.335",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In addition to the rules mentioned in section 98 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997, the rule set out in subsection (2) of\nthis section is a service provider rule for the purposes of that Act.\n\n(2) A carriage service provider must comply with:\n\n(a) any standard access obligations that are applicable to the\nprovider; and\n\n(aa) any rule in section 152AXC or 152AXD that is applicable to\nthe provider; and\n\n(b) any obligations under section 152AYA that are applicable to\nthe provider.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In addition to the rules mentioned in section 98 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997, the rule set out in subsection (2) of\nthis section is a service provider rule for the purposes of that Act.\n\n(2) A carriage service provider must comply with:\n\n(a) any standard access obligations that are applicable to the\nprovider; and\n\n(aa) any rule in section 152AXC or 152AXD that is applicable to\nthe provider; and\n\n(b) any obligations under section 152AYA that are applicable to\nthe provider.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
