      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.342",
      "values:originalText": "(4A) An access determination may be expressed to be an NBN-specific\naccess determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) An access determination may be expressed to be an NBN-specific\naccess determination.",
      "values:partOf": {
