    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152bc-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152BC(4B) Access determinations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152bc-ss-4b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.342",
      "values:originalText": "(4B) An access determination does not apply in relation to access to a\ndeclared service to the extent to which the service is supplied, or is\ncapable of being supplied, by an NBN corporation unless the\naccess determination is expressed to be an NBN-specific access\ndetermination.",
      "skos:definition": "(4B) An access determination does not apply in relation to access to a\ndeclared service to the extent to which the service is supplied, or is\ncapable of being supplied, by an NBN corporation unless the\naccess determination is expressed to be an NBN-specific access\ndetermination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152bc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152bc-ss-4b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152bc-ss-4b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "879209d0fcee7b07b19dab12dae8371398849d590b51eb1fc5161f6c930d7da0",
      "skos:note": "Access determination applies to NBN corporations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152bc-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152BC(4B) Access determinations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 342,
      "values:originalText": "(4B) An access determination does not apply in relation to access to a\ndeclared service to the extent to which the service is supplied, or is\ncapable of being supplied, by an NBN corporation unless the\naccess determination is expressed to be an NBN-specific access\ndetermination."
    },
    {
