    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152CD(2) Enforcement of access undertakings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152cd-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.411",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) any person (the affected person) whose interests are affected\nby the undertaking;\nthinks that the first person has breached the access undertaking, the\nCommission or affected person may apply to the Federal Court for\nan order under subsection (3).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) any person (the affected person) whose interests are affected\nby the undertaking;\nthinks that the first person has breached the access undertaking, the\nCommission or affected person may apply to the Federal Court for\nan order under subsection (3).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "93e61d8b7fd4880c416fce73a44b496dacd5569ad280bafbe2dda523e76f1d41",
      "skos:note": "Application to Federal Court for order under subsection (3) if access undertaking is breached"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152cd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152CD(2) Enforcement of access undertakings",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 411,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) any person (the affected person) whose interests are affected\nby the undertaking;\nthinks that the first person has breached the access undertaking, the\nCommission or affected person may apply to the Federal Court for\nan order under subsection (3)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
