      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "has_breached",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Access undertaking breach",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If the Commission; or any person (the affected person) whose interests are affected by the undertaking;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Commission or affected person may apply to the Federal Court for an order under subsection (3)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152CD(3) Enforcement of access undertakings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152cd-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.411",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Federal Court is satisfied that the first person has breached\nthe undertaking, the Court may make all or any of the following\norders:\n\n(a) an order directing the first person to comply with the\nundertaking;\n\n(b) an order directing the first person to compensate any other\nperson who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the\nbreach;\n\n(c) any other order that the Court thinks appropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the Federal Court is satisfied that the first person has breached\nthe undertaking, the Court may make all or any of the following\norders:\n\n(a) an order directing the first person to comply with the\nundertaking;\n\n(b) an order directing the first person to compensate any other\nperson who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the\nbreach;\n\n(c) any other order that the Court thinks appropriate.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eed71acfc994f141b418f0e394dafa257ffa6e4621482c51810d09c3032b9cc2",
      "skos:note": "Court may order breach of undertaking to comply with or compensate for loss."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152cd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152CD(3) Enforcement of access undertakings",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 411,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Federal Court is satisfied that the first person has breached\nthe undertaking, the Court may make all or any of the following\norders:\n\n(a) an order directing the first person to comply with the\nundertaking;\n\n(b) an order directing the first person to compensate any other\nperson who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the\nbreach;\n\n(c) any other order that the Court thinks appropriate."
    },
