      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.413",
      "values:originalText": "conduct that are inconsistent with Ministerial pricing\ndeterminations\n\n(1) If a provision of an access undertaking is inconsistent with any\nMinisterial pricing determination, the provision has no effect to the\nextent of the inconsistency.\n\n(2) If a provision of an access determination is inconsistent with any\nMinisterial pricing determination, the provision has no effect to the\nextent of the inconsistency.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "conduct that are inconsistent with Ministerial pricing\ndeterminations\n\n(1) If a provision of an access undertaking is inconsistent with any\nMinisterial pricing determination, the provision has no effect to the\nextent of the inconsistency.\n\n(2) If a provision of an access determination is inconsistent with any\nMinisterial pricing determination, the provision has no effect to the\nextent of the inconsistency.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
