      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.414",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nTelecommunications access regime  Part XIC\nSupply of services by NBN corporations  Division 6A\n\nSection 152CJA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nTelecommunications access regime  Part XIC\nSupply of services by NBN corporations  Division 6A\n\nSection 152CJA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cj"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cj-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "92317bcb8296cbe066b43a7bd655be28907ede609458c979206440d1cc3a9c82",
      "skos:note": "Register of Ministerial pricing determinations not a legislative instrument."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152cj-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152CJ(4) Register of Ministerial pricing determinations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 414,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nTelecommunications access regime  Part XIC\nSupply of services by NBN corporations  Division 6A\n\nSection 152CJA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cj-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cj-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
