      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ck-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152CK(5) Relationship between this Part and Part IIIA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ck-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.421",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of this section, if a special access undertaking\ngiven by an NBN corporation is in operation, assume that\nsubsection 152AL(8E) has effect in relation to the undertaking as if\nparagraph 152AL(8E)(c) had not been enacted.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of this section, if a special access undertaking\ngiven by an NBN corporation is in operation, assume that\nsubsection 152AL(8E) has effect in relation to the undertaking as if\nparagraph 152AL(8E)(c) had not been enacted.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ck"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ck-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f7ec74f67b8908769a6496178a9e8864f61b8ba31884b3079207adf68e3412c1",
      "skos:note": "Assumes effect of subsection 152AL(8E) for special access undertakings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-152ck-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152CK(5) Relationship between this Part and Part IIIA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 421,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of this section, if a special access undertaking\ngiven by an NBN corporation is in operation, assume that\nsubsection 152AL(8E) has effect in relation to the undertaking as if\nparagraph 152AL(8E)(c) had not been enacted.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
