      "values:originalText": "This Part applies to a partnership as if the partnership were a\nperson, but it applies with the following changes:\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152en-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
