      "cml:premiseText": "associate has the same meaning as in the Foreign Acquisitions and Takeovers Act 1975.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "associate is defined"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153c-logic-descriptionlogic-3",
