    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "153F Prohibited conduct—electricity financial contract liquidity",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.435",
      "values:originalText": "A corporation contravenes this section if:\n\n(a) any of the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n(i) the corporation generates electricity;\n\n(ii) a body corporate that is related to the corporation\ngenerates electricity; and\n\n(b) the corporation does any of the following:\n\n(i) fails to offer electricity financial contracts;\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "A corporation contravenes this section if:\n\n(a) any of the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n(i) the corporation generates electricity;\n\n(ii) a body corporate that is related to the corporation\ngenerates electricity; and\n\n(b) the corporation does any of the following:\n\n(i) fails to offer electricity financial contracts;\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153f-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153f-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dbd7f110760a8f7b21b23e001caa563ef43e97a2ead22e47f94a5e1fcacadd84",
      "skos:note": "Prohibited conduct—electricity financial contract liquidity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153f",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153F Prohibited conduct—electricity financial contract liquidity",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 435,
      "values:originalText": "A corporation contravenes this section if:\n\n(a) any of the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n(i) the corporation generates electricity;\n\n(ii) a body corporate that is related to the corporation\ngenerates electricity; and\n\n(b) the corporation does any of the following:\n\n(i) fails to offer electricity financial contracts;\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
    {
