    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153j",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "153J Prohibited conduct—purpose",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153j"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.437",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section:\n\n(a) applies for the purposes of sections 153F, 153G and 153H;\nand\n\n(b) does not limit the manner in which the purpose of a person\nmay be established for the purposes of any other provision of\nthis Act.\n\n(2) A corporation may be taken to have done something:\n\n(a) for the purpose of substantially lessening competition in an\nelectricity market; or\n\n(b) for the purpose of distorting or manipulating prices in an\nelectricity spot market;\neven though, after all the evidence has been considered, the\nexistence of that purpose is ascertainable only by inference from\nthe conduct of the corporation or of any other person or from other\nrelevant circumstances.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section:\n\n(a) applies for the purposes of sections 153F, 153G and 153H;\nand\n\n(b) does not limit the manner in which the purpose of a person\nmay be established for the purposes of any other provision of\nthis Act.\n\n(2) A corporation may be taken to have done something:\n\n(a) for the purpose of substantially lessening competition in an\nelectricity market; or\n\n(b) for the purpose of distorting or manipulating prices in an\nelectricity spot market;\neven though, after all the evidence has been considered, the\nexistence of that purpose is ascertainable only by inference from\nthe conduct of the corporation or of any other person or from other\nrelevant circumstances.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153j-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153j-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "31ca1bebd342dcd8cf94070f4b58bb17d687ab27a3abaf53d8147c4e67019511"
    },
    {
