    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153s-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153S(2) Prohibited conduct recommendations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 445,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice must:\n\n(a) be expressed to be given under this section; and\n\n(b) state the day on which the notice is given; and\n\n(c) identify:\n\n(i) the corporation; and\n\n(ii) the prohibited conduct mentioned in paragraph (1)(a);\nand\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153s-ss-2-norm",
