      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.448",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission must give a copy of the notice to the corporation:\n\n(a) unless paragraph (b) applies—45 days after issuing it; or\n\n(b) if the Commission and the Treasurer agree that it is\nappropriate to give a copy of the notice to the corporation at\nan earlier time—at that earlier time.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commission must give a copy of the notice to the corporation:\n\n(a) unless paragraph (b) applies—45 days after issuing it; or\n\n(b) if the Commission and the Treasurer agree that it is\nappropriate to give a copy of the notice to the corporation at\nan earlier time—at that earlier time.",
