    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153v-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "153V(2) Commission may vary or revoke no Treasurer action notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153v-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.448",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commission cannot make a variation or revocation under\nsubsection (1) later than 45 days after:\n\n(a) unless paragraph (b) applies—the day on which the\nCommission made the no Treasurer action notice; or\n\n(b) if there has been a previous variation of the no Treasurer\naction notice under this section—the day on which the\nCommission made the previous variation.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commission cannot make a variation or revocation under\nsubsection (1) later than 45 days after:\n\n(a) unless paragraph (b) applies—the day on which the\nCommission made the no Treasurer action notice; or\n\n(b) if there has been a previous variation of the no Treasurer\naction notice under this section—the day on which the\nCommission made the previous variation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153v"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153v-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153v-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1cd667900e6eb0d0a267e690687341f203fa0ebacad37a752f1891a94550eb78",
      "skos:note": "Commission must provide notice within 45 days of making a variation or revocation.",
      "dc:description": "Notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153v-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153V(2) Commission may vary or revoke no Treasurer action notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 448,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commission cannot make a variation or revocation under\nsubsection (1) later than 45 days after:\n\n(a) unless paragraph (b) applies—the day on which the\nCommission made the no Treasurer action notice; or\n\n(b) if there has been a previous variation of the no Treasurer\naction notice under this section—the day on which the\nCommission made the previous variation."
    },
