      "skos:note": "Commission must satisfy minor or insubstantial variation condition before making a variation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153v-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153V(3) Commission may vary or revoke no Treasurer action notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 448,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission cannot make a variation under subsection (1)\nunless the Commission is satisfied that the variation is minor or\ninsubstantial.\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Electricity Industry  Part XICA\nProcedure before contracting order or divestiture order  Division 4\n\nSection 153V\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
