      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.448",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Commission cannot make a revocation under subsection (1)\nunless the Commission is satisfied that the conditions in\nsubsections (5) and (6) are met.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Commission cannot make a revocation under subsection (1)\nunless the Commission is satisfied that the conditions in\nsubsections (5) and (6) are met.",
