    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153w-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Treasurer has an obligation to make order under section 153X if conditions are met.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Commission has given the Treasurer a prohibited conduct recommendation under section 153S;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Treasurer must make an order under section 153X."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153w-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Classifies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Body corporate is identified in the recommendation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the body corporate is identified in the recommendation (in accordance with subparagraph 153S(2)(c)(i) or (iii));",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The body corporate is classified as a relevant corporation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153w-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Within",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Order must be made within 45 days after Commission gave recommendation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the order is made no later than 45 days after the day on which the Commission gave the Treasurer the recommendation;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The order must be made within 45 days after the Commission gave the recommendation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153w-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Treasurer has an obligation to make order under section 153X if conditions are met.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Treasurer must make an order under section 153X.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Treasurer has an obligation to make an order under section 153X."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153w-logic-descriptionlogic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Classifies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Order is of a kind stated in the recommendation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the order is of a kind stated in the recommendation (in accordance with paragraph 153S(2)(d));",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The order is classified as a relevant type."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "153X Treasurer may make contracting order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153x"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.452",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Treasurer may, in writing, order the body corporate to make\noffers to enter into electricity financial contracts.\n\n(2) The order must:\n\n(a) be expressed to be made under this section; and\n\n(b) state the day on which the order is made; and\n\n(c) identify:\n\n(i) the body corporate; and\n\n(ii) if the body corporate is not the relevant corporation—\nthe relevant corporation; and\n\n(iii) the prohibited conduct mentioned in\nparagraph 153W(e); and\n\n(d) explain the reasons why the Treasurer is satisfied that the\nconditions in paragraphs 153W(e) and (f) are met; and\n\n(e) specify the matters mentioned in subsection (3).\n\n(3) The matters are as follows:\n\n(a) the kind of offers that the body corporate must make to enter\ninto electricity financial contracts;\n\n(b) the manner in which the body corporate must make those\noffers;\n\n(c) the kind of entities to which those offers must be made;\n\n(d) the period or periods during which the body corporate must\nmake those offers;\n\n(e) any other matter that the Treasurer considers necessary for\nthe order to be effective.\n\n(4) The order may specify the kind of offers that the body corporate\nmust make in any of the following ways:\n\n(a) the kind of electricity financial contracts that must be offered;\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Electricity Industry  Part XICA\nContracting orders  Division 5\n\nSection 153Y\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the price or range of prices in respect of electricity under the\nelectricity financial contracts that must be offered, or a\nmethod or methods of working out that price or that range;\n\n(c) the minimum number of megawatt hours of electricity to\nwhich the electricity financial contracts that must be offered\nmust relate.\n\n(5) In determining the minimum number of megawatt hours to specify\nfor the purposes of paragraph (4)(c), the Treasurer must have\nregard to the following matters:\n\n(a) the total electricity generation capacity of the electricity\ngeneration assets held by each connected body corporate in\nrelation to the prohibited conduct and related bodies\ncorporate;\n\n(b) the nature and location of those electricity generation assets;\n\n(c) the commitments that the body corporate has, and related\nbodies corporate have, to supply electricity to customers;\n\n(d) any other matter that the Treasurer considers to be relevant.\n\n(6) The specified period or periods during which the body corporate\nmust make those offers must:\n\n(a) start no earlier than 6 months after the order is made; and\n\n(b) end no later than 3 years after the order is made.\n\n(7) The Treasurer must publish, by electronic or other means, the\nfollowing information:\n\n(a) the fact that the order has been made;\n\n(b) the day on which the order is made;\n\n(c) the name of the body corporate.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Treasurer may, in writing, order the body corporate to make\noffers to enter into electricity financial contracts.\n\n(2) The order must:\n\n(a) be expressed to be made under this section; and\n\n(b) state the day on which the order is made; and\n\n(c) identify:\n\n(i) the body corporate; and\n\n(ii) if the body corporate is not the relevant corporation—\nthe relevant corporation; and\n\n(iii) the prohibited conduct mentioned in\nparagraph 153W(e); and\n\n(d) explain the reasons why the Treasurer is satisfied that the\nconditions in paragraphs 153W(e) and (f) are met; and\n\n(e) specify the matters mentioned in subsection (3).\n\n(3) The matters are as follows:\n\n(a) the kind of offers that the body corporate must make to enter\ninto electricity financial contracts;\n\n(b) the manner in which the body corporate must make those\noffers;\n\n(c) the kind of entities to which those offers must be made;\n\n(d) the period or periods during which the body corporate must\nmake those offers;\n\n(e) any other matter that the Treasurer considers necessary for\nthe order to be effective.\n\n(4) The order may specify the kind of offers that the body corporate\nmust make in any of the following ways:\n\n(a) the kind of electricity financial contracts that must be offered;\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Electricity Industry  Part XICA\nContracting orders  Division 5\n\nSection 153Y\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the price or range of prices in respect of electricity under the\nelectricity financial contracts that must be offered, or a\nmethod or methods of working out that price or that range;\n\n(c) the minimum number of megawatt hours of electricity to\nwhich the electricity financial contracts that must be offered\nmust relate.\n\n(5) In determining the minimum number of megawatt hours to specify\nfor the purposes of paragraph (4)(c), the Treasurer must have\nregard to the following matters:\n\n(a) the total electricity generation capacity of th",
