      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 452,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The order may specify the kind of offers that the body corporate\nmust make in any of the following ways:\n\n(a) the kind of electricity financial contracts that must be offered;\n\nFurther provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7\nThe Electricity Industry  Part XICA\nContracting orders  Division 5\n\nSection 153Y\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the price or range of prices in respect of electricity under the\nelectricity financial contracts that must be offered, or a\nmethod or methods of working out that price or that range;\n\n(c) the minimum number of megawatt hours of electricity to\nwhich the electricity financial contracts that must be offered\nmust relate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Treasurer has a duty to specify the kind of offers that the body corporate must make.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "SPECIFY",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Treasurer must specify the kind of offers that the body corporate must make in certain ways.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "153X(5) Treasurer may make contracting order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153x-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.452",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In determining the minimum number of megawatt hours to specify\nfor the purposes of paragraph (4)(c), the Treasurer must have\nregard to the following matters:\n\n(a) the total electricity generation capacity of the electricity\ngeneration assets held by each connected body corporate in\nrelation to the prohibited conduct and related bodies\ncorporate;\n\n(b) the nature and location of those electricity generation assets;\n\n(c) the commitments that the body corporate has, and related\nbodies corporate have, to supply electricity to customers;\n\n(d) any other matter that the Treasurer considers to be relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In determining the minimum number of megawatt hours to specify\nfor the purposes of paragraph (4)(c), the Treasurer must have\nregard to the following matters:\n\n(a) the total electricity generation capacity of the electricity\ngeneration assets held by each connected body corporate in\nrelation to the prohibited conduct and related bodies\ncorporate;\n\n(b) the nature and location of those electricity generation assets;\n\n(c) the commitments that the body corporate has, and related\nbodies corporate have, to supply electricity to customers;\n\n(d) any other matter that the Treasurer considers to be relevant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "24c639933d1c245e633921873ea2acfcd7c2512b4f53a1d254fa3b4cc563327f",
      "skos:note": "Treasurer must consider certain matters when determining minimum electricity generation capacity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153x-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153X(5) Treasurer may make contracting order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 452,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In determining the minimum number of megawatt hours to specify\nfor the purposes of paragraph (4)(c), the Treasurer must have\nregard to the following matters:\n\n(a) the total electricity generation capacity of the electricity\ngeneration assets held by each connected body corporate in\nrelation to the prohibited conduct and related bodies\ncorporate;\n\n(b) the nature and location of those electricity generation assets;\n\n(c) the commitments that the body corporate has, and related\nbodies corporate have, to supply electricity to customers;\n\n(d) any other matter that the Treasurer considers to be relevant."
    },
