      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.452",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The specified period or periods during which the body corporate\nmust make those offers must:\n\n(a) start no earlier than 6 months after the order is made; and\n\n(b) end no later than 3 years after the order is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The specified period or periods during which the body corporate\nmust make those offers must:\n\n(a) start no earlier than 6 months after the order is made; and\n\n(b) end no later than 3 years after the order is made.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "50256089392f13b24c1777f785eec18093b4bfc169ad73fa279f9342e071761d",
      "skos:note": "Treasurer must make contracting order within specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153x-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153X(6) Treasurer may make contracting order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 452,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The specified period or periods during which the body corporate\nmust make those offers must:\n\n(a) start no earlier than 6 months after the order is made; and\n\n(b) end no later than 3 years after the order is made."
    },
