    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153zd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "153ZD No orders under subsection 76(1) against certain individuals",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153zd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.461",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Nothing in subsection 76(1) authorises the making of an order\nagainst an individual covered under subsection (2) because the\nindividual:\n\n(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a corporation to\ncontravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(b) has induced, or attempted to induce, a corporation, whether\nby threats or promises or otherwise, to contravene\nsection 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention by a corporation\nof section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(d) has conspired with others for a corporation to contravene\nsection 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H.\n\n(2) An individual is covered under this section unless the individual is\na director, secretary or senior manager (within the meaning of the\nCorporations Act 2001) of the corporation.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Nothing in subsection 76(1) authorises the making of an order\nagainst an individual covered under subsection (2) because the\nindividual:\n\n(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a corporation to\ncontravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(b) has induced, or attempted to induce, a corporation, whether\nby threats or promises or otherwise, to contravene\nsection 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention by a corporation\nof section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(d) has conspired with others for a corporation to contravene\nsection 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H.\n\n(2) An individual is covered under this section unless the individual is\na director, secretary or senior manager (within the meaning of the\nCorporations Act 2001) of the corporation.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153zd-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153zd-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b51cdda9c9173d95215a531cb10c53627163373fb2f81a9759bdb7647d9812f9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-153zd",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "153ZD No orders under subsection 76(1) against certain individuals",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 461,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Nothing in subsection 76(1) authorises the making of an order\nagainst an individual covered under subsection (2) because the\nindividual:\n\n(a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a corporation to\ncontravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(b) has induced, or attempted to induce, a corporation, whether\nby threats or promises or otherwise, to contravene\nsection 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention by a corporation\nof section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or\n\n(d) has conspired with others for a corporation to contravene\nsection 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H.\n\n(2) An individual is covered under this section unless the individual is\na director, secretary or senior manager (within the meaning of the\nCorporations Act 2001) of the corporation.\n\nChapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."
    },
