      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154B Appointment of inspectors",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.494",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Chairperson may, by writing, appoint a member of the staff\nassisting the Commission to be an inspector.\nStaff member to have suitable qualifications and experience\n\n(2) The Chairperson must not do so unless he or she is satisfied that\nthe staff member has suitable qualifications and experience to\nproperly exercise the powers of an inspector.\nInspector to comply with Chairperson’s directions\n\n(3) An inspector must comply with any directions of the Chairperson\nin exercising powers or performing functions as an inspector.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Chairperson may, by writing, appoint a member of the staff\nassisting the Commission to be an inspector.\nStaff member to have suitable qualifications and experience\n\n(2) The Chairperson must not do so unless he or she is satisfied that\nthe staff member has suitable qualifications and experience to\nproperly exercise the powers of an inspector.\nInspector to comply with Chairperson’s directions\n\n(3) An inspector must comply with any directions of the Chairperson\nin exercising powers or performing functions as an inspector.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154b-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154b-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "46294681e1352321bc2185bf172b3daa3b59ecfa6d5c722c4d065a960085abbf"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154B Appointment of inspectors",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 494,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Chairperson may, by writing, appoint a member of the staff\nassisting the Commission to be an inspector.\nStaff member to have suitable qualifications and experience\n\n(2) The Chairperson must not do so unless he or she is satisfied that\nthe staff member has suitable qualifications and experience to\nproperly exercise the powers of an inspector.\nInspector to comply with Chairperson’s directions\n\n(3) An inspector must comply with any directions of the Chairperson\nin exercising powers or performing functions as an inspector."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154b-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154B(1) Appointment of inspectors",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154b-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
