      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.494",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Chairperson may, by writing, appoint a member of the staff\nassisting the Commission to be an inspector.\nStaff member to have suitable qualifications and experience",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Chairperson may, by writing, appoint a member of the staff\nassisting the Commission to be an inspector.\nStaff member to have suitable qualifications and experience",
