    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154C Identity cards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.494",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Chairperson must issue an identity card to an inspector.\nForm of identity card\n\n(2) The identity card must:\n\n(a) contain the information prescribed by the regulations; and\n\n(b) contain a recent photograph of the inspector.\nOffence\n\n(3) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person has been issued with an identity card; and\n\n(b) the person ceases to be an inspector; and\n\n(c) the person does not return the identity card to the\nChairperson as soon as practicable.\nPenalty: 1 penalty unit.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nSearch and seizure  Part XID\nAppointment of inspectors and identity cards  Division 2\n\nSection 154C\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(4) An offence against subsection (3) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.\nCard lost or destroyed\n\n(5) Subsection (3) does not apply if the identity card was lost or\ndestroyed.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this\nsubsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code.\nInspector must carry card\n\n(6) An inspector must carry his or her identity card at all times when\nexercising powers or performing functions as an inspector.\nInspector must produce card on request\n\n(7) An inspector is not entitled to exercise any powers under this\nPart in relation to premises if:\n\n(a) the occupier of the premises has requested the inspector to\nproduce the inspector’s identity card for inspection by the\noccupier; and\n\n(b) the inspector fails to comply with the request.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Chairperson must issue an identity card to an inspector.\nForm of identity card\n\n(2) The identity card must:\n\n(a) contain the information prescribed by the regulations; and\n\n(b) contain a recent photograph of the inspector.\nOffence\n\n(3) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person has been issued with an identity card; and\n\n(b) the person ceases to be an inspector; and\n\n(c) the person does not return the identity card to the\nChairperson as soon as practicable.\nPenalty: 1 penalty unit.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nSearch and seizure  Part XID\nAppointment of inspectors and identity cards  Division 2\n\nSection 154C\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(4) An offence against subsection (3) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.\nCard lost or destroyed\n\n(5) Subsection (3) does not apply if the identity card was lost or\ndestroyed.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this\nsubsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code.\nInspector must carry card\n\n(6) An inspector must carry his or her identity card at all times when\nexercising powers or performing functions as an inspector.\nInspector must produce card on request\n\n(7) An inspector is not entitled to exercise any powers under this\nPart in relation to premises if:\n\n(a) the occupier of the premises has requested the inspector to\nproduce the inspector’s identity card for inspection by the\noccupier; and\n\n(b) the inspector fails to comply with the request.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-5"
        },
        {
