    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154C(7) Identity cards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154c-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.494",
      "values:originalText": "(7) An inspector is not entitled to exercise any powers under this\nPart in relation to premises if:\n\n(a) the occupier of the premises has requested the inspector to\nproduce the inspector’s identity card for inspection by the\noccupier; and\n\n(b) the inspector fails to comply with the request.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(7) An inspector is not entitled to exercise any powers under this\nPart in relation to premises if:\n\n(a) the occupier of the premises has requested the inspector to\nproduce the inspector’s identity card for inspection by the\noccupier; and\n\n(b) the inspector fails to comply with the request.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-7-norm"
        },
