    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154ga-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154GA(2) Removing things for examination or processing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154ga-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.500",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a thing is moved to another place for the purpose of examination\nor processing under subsection (1), the executing officer must, if it\nis practicable to do so:\n\n(a) inform the occupier of the address of the place and the time\nat which the examination or processing will be carried out;\nand\n\n(b) allow the occupier or his or her representative to be present\nduring the examination or processing.\nPeriod of removal",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If a thing is moved to another place for the purpose of examination\nor processing under subsection (1), the executing officer must, if it\nis practicable to do so:\n\n(a) inform the occupier of the address of the place and the time\nat which the examination or processing will be carried out;\nand\n\n(b) allow the occupier or his or her representative to be present\nduring the examination or processing.\nPeriod of removal",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154ga"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154ga-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154ga-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "705f0588df519f2f457d1539e3e9aa030b24a7d14a5c8a7c401eff16505e532c",
      "skos:note": "Inform occupier and allow presence during examination or processing.",
      "dc:description": "Information about address and time, Presence of occupier or representative."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154ga-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154GA(2) Removing things for examination or processing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 500,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a thing is moved to another place for the purpose of examination\nor processing under subsection (1), the executing officer must, if it\nis practicable to do so:\n\n(a) inform the occupier of the address of the place and the time\nat which the examination or processing will be carried out;\nand\n\n(b) allow the occupier or his or her representative to be present\nduring the examination or processing.\nPeriod of removal"
    },
