      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.500",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The executing officer must give notice of the application to the\noccupier of the premises of his or her intention to apply for an\nextension, and the occupier is entitled to be heard in relation to the\napplication.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The executing officer must give notice of the application to the\noccupier of the premises of his or her intention to apply for an\nextension, and the occupier is entitled to be heard in relation to the\napplication.",
