      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.508",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply if possession of the\ndocument, film, computer file, thing or information by the occupier\ncould constitute an offence against a law of the Commonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply if possession of the\ndocument, film, computer file, thing or information by the occupier\ncould constitute an offence against a law of the Commonwealth.",
