      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The magistrate may issue the warrant if there may be evidential material on the premises within the next 72 hours.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The magistrate MUST issue the warrant IF THERE MAY BE EVIDENTIAL MATERIAL WITHIN 72 HOURS."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-2-logic-argumentation-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "ISSUE Warrant",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Magistrate's decision to issue warrant is based on reasonable grounds.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The magistrate may issue the warrant if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The magistrate SHOULD ISSUE THE WARRANT BASED ON REASONABLE GROUNDS."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "WITHIN 72 HOURS",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Magistrate must consider evidence within a specific time interval.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The magistrate may issue the warrant if there may be evidential material on the premises within the next 72 hours.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The magistrate MUST ISSUE THE WARRANT WITHIN 72 HOURS."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154X(3) Issue of search warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154x-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.510",
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, the magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the\ninspector or some other person has given to the magistrate, either\norally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the\nmagistrate requires concerning the grounds on which the issue of\nthe warrant is being sought.\nContent of warrant",
      "skos:definition": "(3) However, the magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the\ninspector or some other person has given to the magistrate, either\norally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the\nmagistrate requires concerning the grounds on which the issue of\nthe warrant is being sought.\nContent of warrant",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "17fe017420999344da5f74f1e369654de6bc6a0f4f17a77ea21920f40fdc5214",
      "skos:note": "Magistrate must provide additional information before issuing a warrant.",
      "dc:description": "Additional information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154x-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154X(3) Issue of search warrants",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 510,
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, the magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the\ninspector or some other person has given to the magistrate, either\norally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the\nmagistrate requires concerning the grounds on which the issue of\nthe warrant is being sought.\nContent of warrant"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-3-norm",
