    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154X(4) Issue of search warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154x-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.510",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The warrant must state:\n\n(a) a description of the premises to which the warrant relates;\nand\n\n(b) the kind of evidential material that is to be searched for under\nthe warrant (including stating the contraventions to which the\nwarrant relates); and\n\n(c) the name of the inspector who is to be responsible for\nexecuting the warrant; and\n\n(d) whether the warrant may be executed at any time of the day\nor night or during specified hours of the day or night; and\n\n(e) the day (not more than one week after the issue of the\nwarrant) on which the warrant ceases to have effect.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The warrant must state:\n\n(a) a description of the premises to which the warrant relates;\nand\n\n(b) the kind of evidential material that is to be searched for under\nthe warrant (including stating the contraventions to which the\nwarrant relates); and\n\n(c) the name of the inspector who is to be responsible for\nexecuting the warrant; and\n\n(d) whether the warrant may be executed at any time of the day\nor night or during specified hours of the day or night; and\n\n(e) the day (not more than one week after the issue of the\nwarrant) on which the warrant ceases to have effect.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154x-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "877deb02648ac0e3d2ed7ede50a00c7cd091d4b49fa1a7aec2e184cd3846d350",
      "skos:note": "Warrant must state certain information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154x-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154X(4) Issue of search warrants",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 510,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The warrant must state:\n\n(a) a description of the premises to which the warrant relates;\nand\n\n(b) the kind of evidential material that is to be searched for under\nthe warrant (including stating the contraventions to which the\nwarrant relates); and\n\n(c) the name of the inspector who is to be responsible for\nexecuting the warrant; and\n\n(d) whether the warrant may be executed at any time of the day\nor night or during specified hours of the day or night; and\n\n(e) the day (not more than one week after the issue of the\nwarrant) on which the warrant ceases to have effect.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
    {
