      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 524,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The withdrawn complaint continues to be a designated complaint\nfor the purposes of this Act (including subsection 154ZF(3) and\nparagraph 171(3)(dd))."
