    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zp-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154ZP(4) Application for approval as designated complainant",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zp-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.527",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the designated complaints\ndetermination may:\n\n(a) prescribe a period, which may be a single period or a\nrecurring period; and\n\n(b) provide for the start or end date of the period or each period\n(as the case may be) to be as is or will be set out on the\nDepartment’s website.\nWithdrawal of application",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the designated complaints\ndetermination may:\n\n(a) prescribe a period, which may be a single period or a\nrecurring period; and\n\n(b) provide for the start or end date of the period or each period\n(as the case may be) to be as is or will be set out on the\nDepartment’s website.\nWithdrawal of application",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zp"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zp-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a5914a6a0fd0bc9d9e6fc5d193c1f8b24ba2ff7a86d0dc531adbc26e488c112a",
      "skos:note": "Prescribes period and start/end dates for designated complaints determination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zp-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154ZP(4) Application for approval as designated complainant",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 527,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the designated complaints\ndetermination may:\n\n(a) prescribe a period, which may be a single period or a\nrecurring period; and\n\n(b) provide for the start or end date of the period or each period\n(as the case may be) to be as is or will be set out on the\nDepartment’s website.\nWithdrawal of application"
    },
