      "skos:note": "Minister may grant approval for designated complainants"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zq-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154ZQ(4) Minister may grant approval",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 528,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of paragraphs (2)(c) and (3)(a), the designated\ncomplaints determination may prescribe matters to which the\nMinister:\n\n(a) must have regard; or\n\n(b) may have regard.\nMaximum number of designated complainants"
    },
    {
