      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zq-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Cannot",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on granting approval",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Minister's power to grant approval",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Approval cannot be granted"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zq-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Within",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Approval must be granted within a specific time frame",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Limit prescribed in designated complaints determination",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Approval must be granted before the limit is exceeded"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zr",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154ZR Conditions in approval",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zr"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.529",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the\nMinister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate.\nConsiderations\n\n(2) For the purposes of being satisfied that the conditions are\nappropriate, the Minister:\n\n(a) must have regard to the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 154ZQ(2); and\n\n(b) may have regard to the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 154ZQ(3).\nConditions notices\n\n(3) If the Minister is considering:\n\n(a) granting the approval; and\n\n(b) specifying that it is subject to conditions;\nthe Minister may give the applicant a notice in writing setting out\nthose conditions.\n\n(4) If the Minister gives the applicant a notice under subsection (3), the\nMinister must give the Commission a copy of the notice as soon as\npracticable.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the\nMinister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate.\nConsiderations\n\n(2) For the purposes of being satisfied that the conditions are\nappropriate, the Minister:\n\n(a) must have regard to the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 154ZQ(2); and\n\n(b) may have regard to the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 154ZQ(3).\nConditions notices\n\n(3) If the Minister is considering:\n\n(a) granting the approval; and\n\n(b) specifying that it is subject to conditions;\nthe Minister may give the applicant a notice in writing setting out\nthose conditions.\n\n(4) If the Minister gives the applicant a notice under subsection (3), the\nMinister must give the Commission a copy of the notice as soon as\npracticable.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zr-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zr-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zr-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zr-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7ff82a01ed9376ec0d667682821406ac864d3e48844b92e74d1092a07bc98503"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zr",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154ZR Conditions in approval",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 529,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the\nMinister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate.\nConsiderations\n\n(2) For the purposes of being satisfied that the conditions are\nappropriate, the Minister:\n\n(a) must have regard to the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 154ZQ(2); and\n\n(b) may have regard to the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 154ZQ(3).\nConditions notices\n\n(3) If the Minister is considering:\n\n(a) granting the approval; and\n\n(b) specifying that it is subject to conditions;\nthe Minister may give the applicant a notice in writing setting out\nthose conditions.\n\n(4) If the Minister gives the applicant a notice under subsection (3), the\nMinister must give the Commission a copy of the notice as soon as\npracticable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zr-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154ZR(1) Conditions in approval",
