      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.529",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the\nMinister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate.\nConsiderations",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the\nMinister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate.\nConsiderations",
      "values:partOf": {
