        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zt",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154ZT Notice of decision on application for approval",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zt"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.530",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to grant the approval; or\n\n(b) decides not to grant the approval;\nthe Minister must give the applicant, as soon as practicable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to grant the approval—a copy of the\napproval.\n\n(2) If the Minister decides to grant the approval, as soon as practicable\nafter granting the approval, the Minister:\n\n(a) must give a copy of the notice of the decision to the\nCommission; and\n\n(b) must publish the name of the entity on the Department’s\nwebsite; and\n\n(c) may publish all or parts of the conditions (if any) to which\nthe approval is subject on the Department’s website.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to grant the approval; or\n\n(b) decides not to grant the approval;\nthe Minister must give the applicant, as soon as practicable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to grant the approval—a copy of the\napproval.\n\n(2) If the Minister decides to grant the approval, as soon as practicable\nafter granting the approval, the Minister:\n\n(a) must give a copy of the notice of the decision to the\nCommission; and\n\n(b) must publish the name of the entity on the Department’s\nwebsite; and\n\n(c) may publish all or parts of the conditions (if any) to which\nthe approval is subject on the Department’s website.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zt-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zt-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "aecdb3f6eb2a67fc97582c9cdb36e4dc7f5add5c6b3bc1f0fe7961e181e76ae8"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zt",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154ZT Notice of decision on application for approval",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 530,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to grant the approval; or\n\n(b) decides not to grant the approval;\nthe Minister must give the applicant, as soon as practicable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to grant the approval—a copy of the\napproval.\n\n(2) If the Minister decides to grant the approval, as soon as practicable\nafter granting the approval, the Minister:\n\n(a) must give a copy of the notice of the decision to the\nCommission; and\n\n(b) must publish the name of the entity on the Department’s\nwebsite; and\n\n(c) may publish all or parts of the conditions (if any) to which\nthe approval is subject on the Department’s website."
    },
