      "cof:pageNumber": 531,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The notice must set out the following:\n\n(a) the proposed variation or revocation;\n\n(b) the reasons for the proposed variation or revocation;\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zv-ss-5-norm",
