    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zw",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154ZW Contents of variation or revocation of approval",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zw"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.532",
      "values:originalText": "A variation or revocation made under section 154ZV must specify\nthe details of the variation or revocation, including:\n\n(a) the day on which the decision to make the variation or\nrevocation was made; and\n\n(b) the day on which the variation or revocation takes effect; and\n\n(c) in the case of a variation that changes or removes the date on\nwhich the approval ceases to be in force—that change or\nremoval; and\n\n(d) in the case of a variation that changes or removes conditions\nto which the approval is subject—that change or removal.",
      "skos:definition": "A variation or revocation made under section 154ZV must specify\nthe details of the variation or revocation, including:\n\n(a) the day on which the decision to make the variation or\nrevocation was made; and\n\n(b) the day on which the variation or revocation takes effect; and\n\n(c) in the case of a variation that changes or removes the date on\nwhich the approval ceases to be in force—that change or\nremoval; and\n\n(d) in the case of a variation that changes or removes conditions\nto which the approval is subject—that change or removal.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zw-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4b77720e43b221638b3197b0f92e20bc9c0951c1d14be104d492afa742022ada",
      "skos:note": "Details of variation or revocation of approval must be specified.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zw",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154ZW Contents of variation or revocation of approval",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 532,
      "values:originalText": "A variation or revocation made under section 154ZV must specify\nthe details of the variation or revocation, including:\n\n(a) the day on which the decision to make the variation or\nrevocation was made; and\n\n(b) the day on which the variation or revocation takes effect; and\n\n(c) in the case of a variation that changes or removes the date on\nwhich the approval ceases to be in force—that change or\nremoval; and\n\n(d) in the case of a variation that changes or removes conditions\nto which the approval is subject—that change or removal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zw-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zw"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zx",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154ZX Notice of decision on application for variation or revocation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zx"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.532",
      "values:originalText": "of approval\n\n(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to vary or revoke a designated complainant’s\napproval; or\n\n(b) in a case where a designated complainant has applied for a\nvariation or revocation of its approval—decides not to vary\nor revoke the approval;\nthe Minister must give the designated complainant, as soon as\npracticable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to vary or revoke the approval—a copy of\nthe variation or revocation.\n\n(2) As soon as practicable after varying or revoking the approval, the\nMinister:\n\n(a) must give a copy of the notice of the decision to the\nCommission; and\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nDesignated complaints  Part XIE\nDesignated complainants  Division 3\n\nSection 154ZX\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) in the case of a revocation—must publish that fact on the\nDepartment’s website; and\n\n(c) in the case of a variation that changes or removes conditions\nto which the approval is subject—may publish details of that\nchange or removal on the Department’s website.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "of approval\n\n(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to vary or revoke a designated complainant’s\napproval; or\n\n(b) in a case where a designated complainant has applied for a\nvariation or revocation of its approval—decides not to vary\nor revoke the approval;\nthe Minister must give the designated complainant, as soon as\npracticable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to vary or revoke the approval—a copy of\nthe variation or revocation.\n\n(2) As soon as practicable after varying or revoking the approval, the\nMinister:\n\n(a) must give a copy of the notice of the decision to the\nCommission; and\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nDesignated complaints  Part XIE\nDesignated complainants  Division 3\n\nSection 154ZX\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) in the case of a revocation—must publish that fact on the\nDepartment’s website; and\n\n(c) in the case of a variation that changes or removes conditions\nto which the approval is subject—may publish details of that\nchange or removal on the Department’s website.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zx-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zx-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1a62b261375826e253ae4533a10421dcf355fcd9b9b4d84785864a600d6df121"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-154zx",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154ZX Notice of decision on application for variation or revocation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 532,
      "values:originalText": "of approval\n\n(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to vary or revoke a designated complainant’s\napproval; or\n\n(b) in a case where a designated complainant has applied for a\nvariation or revocation of its approval—decides not to vary\nor revoke the approval;\nthe Minister must give the designated complainant, as soon as\npracticable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to vary or revoke the approval—a copy of\nthe variation or revocation.\n\n(2) As soon as practicable after varying or revoking the approval, the\nMinister:\n\n(a) must give a copy of the notice of the decision to the\nCommission; and\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nDesignated complaints  Part XIE\nDesignated complainants  Division 3\n\nSection 154ZX\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) in the case of a revocation—must publish that fact on the\nDepartment’s website; and\n\n(c) in the case of a variation that changes or removes conditions\nto which the approval is subject—may publish details of that\nchange or removal on the Department’s website.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
