      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Minister:\n\n(a) decides to vary or revoke a designated complainant’s\napproval; or\n\n(b) in a case where a designated complainant has applied for a\nvariation or revocation of its approval—decides not to vary\nor revoke the approval;\nthe Minister must give the designated complainant, as soon as\npracticable:\n\n(c) notice of the decision; and\n\n(d) if the decision is to vary or revoke the approval—a copy of\nthe variation or revocation."
