      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.534",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, in writing, delegate all or any of the Minister’s\npowers or functions under this Part (other than under\nsection 154ZZ) to the Secretary, or a SES employee or acting SES\nemployee in the Department.\n\n(2) In exercising a power under a delegation under this section, the\ndelegate must comply with any written directions of the Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, in writing, delegate all or any of the Minister’s\npowers or functions under this Part (other than under\nsection 154ZZ) to the Secretary, or a SES employee or acting SES\nemployee in the Department.\n\n(2) In exercising a power under a delegation under this section, the\ndelegate must comply with any written directions of the Minister.",
