    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "155AA(3) Protection of Part VB information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-155aa-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.548",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nCommission official means:\n\n(a) a member, or associate member, of the Commission;\n\n(b) a person referred to in subsection 27(1);\n\n(c) a person engaged under section 27A.\ndisclose means divulge or communicate.\ninformation includes information in a document and information\ngiven in evidence.\nprotected Part VB information means:\n\n(a) information that:\n\n(i) was obtained by the Commission under Part XID or\nsection 155; and\n\n(ii) relates to a matter that arose under Part VB before its\nrepeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake\n(Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009; or\n\n(b) information that was obtained by the Commission under\nsection 75AY before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to\nthe Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In this section:\nCommission official means:\n\n(a) a member, or associate member, of the Commission;\n\n(b) a person referred to in subsection 27(1);\n\n(c) a person engaged under section 27A.\ndisclose means divulge or communicate.\ninformation includes information in a document and information\ngiven in evidence.\nprotected Part VB information means:\n\n(a) information that:\n\n(i) was obtained by the Commission under Part XID or\nsection 155; and\n\n(ii) relates to a matter that arose under Part VB before its\nrepeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake\n(Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009; or\n\n(b) information that was obtained by the Commission under\nsection 75AY before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to\nthe Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "36cc8334c695a10e0bbbd617f44b42cf57e012317a65da50a170d6cd602039ee",
      "skos:note": "Definition of Commission official and protected Part VB information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-155aa-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "155AA(3) Protection of Part VB information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 548,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nCommission official means:\n\n(a) a member, or associate member, of the Commission;\n\n(b) a person referred to in subsection 27(1);\n\n(c) a person engaged under section 27A.\ndisclose means divulge or communicate.\ninformation includes information in a document and information\ngiven in evidence.\nprotected Part VB information means:\n\n(a) information that:\n\n(i) was obtained by the Commission under Part XID or\nsection 155; and\n\n(ii) relates to a matter that arose under Part VB before its\nrepeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake\n(Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009; or\n\n(b) information that was obtained by the Commission under\nsection 75AY before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to\nthe Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009."
    },
