      },
      "cml:premiseText": "protected Part VB information means information that was obtained by the Commission under Part XID or section 155;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "or information that was obtained by the Commission under section 75AY before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009."
