      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.550",
      "values:originalText": "(2) As soon as practicable after the information or document is\nprovided to the Australian Competition and Consumer\nCommission, the Australian Competition and Consumer\nCommission is to transmit it to the New Zealand Commerce\nCommission.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) As soon as practicable after the information or document is\nprovided to the Australian Competition and Consumer\nCommission, the Australian Competition and Consumer\nCommission is to transmit it to the New Zealand Commerce\nCommission.",
