      "skos:note": "Must transmit information to New Zealand Commerce Commission"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-155b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "155B(2) Australian Competition and Consumer Commission may",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 550,
      "values:originalText": "(2) As soon as practicable after the information or document is\nprovided to the Australian Competition and Consumer\nCommission, the Australian Competition and Consumer\nCommission is to transmit it to the New Zealand Commerce\nCommission."
    },
