      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.550",
      "values:originalText": "(5) This section binds the Crown in all its capacities, but nothing in\nthis section permits the Crown in any of its capacities to be\nprosecuted for an offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) This section binds the Crown in all its capacities, but nothing in\nthis section permits the Crown in any of its capacities to be\nprosecuted for an offence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155b"
