      "values:originalText": "(3) Until such a certified copy is supplied, the Commission shall, at\nsuch times and places as it thinks appropriate, permit the person\notherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a person\nauthorised by that person, to inspect and make copies of or take\nextracts from the document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-156-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
