    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "157A Disclosure of energy-related information by Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-157a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.555",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) the AER; or\n\n(b) the AEMC; or\n\n(c) any staff or consultant assisting the AER or the AEMC in\nperforming its functions or exercising its powers;\nany information that it obtains under this Act or a gas market\ninstrument that is relevant to the functions or powers of the AER or\nthe AEMC.\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and\ndisclosure of information.\n\n(2) The AER or a person mentioned in paragraph (1)(c) may use the\ninformation for any purpose connected with the performance of the\nAER’s functions or the exercise of its powers.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) the AER; or\n\n(b) the AEMC; or\n\n(c) any staff or consultant assisting the AER or the AEMC in\nperforming its functions or exercising its powers;\nany information that it obtains under this Act or a gas market\ninstrument that is relevant to the functions or powers of the AER or\nthe AEMC.\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and\ndisclosure of information.\n\n(2) The AER or a person mentioned in paragraph (1)(c) may use the\ninformation for any purpose connected with the performance of the\nAER’s functions or the exercise of its powers.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0061cd217379b182c345954b78b613327f2b1bac00be01d5d79392844a6865b7"
    },
