    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "157AA(2A) Disclosure of CDR-related information by Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-157aa-ss-2a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.556",
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) the Secretary of the Department; or\n\n(b) any employee of the Department or consultant assisting the\nSecretary in performing the Secretary’s functions, or\nexercising the Secretary’s powers, relating to Part IVD;\nany information that the Commission obtains under this Act, or the\nconsumer data rules, that is relevant or likely to be relevant to the\nfunctions or powers referred to in paragraph (b).\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and\ndisclosure of information.",
      "skos:definition": "(2A) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) the Secretary of the Department; or\n\n(b) any employee of the Department or consultant assisting the\nSecretary in performing the Secretary’s functions, or\nexercising the Secretary’s powers, relating to Part IVD;\nany information that the Commission obtains under this Act, or the\nconsumer data rules, that is relevant or likely to be relevant to the\nfunctions or powers referred to in paragraph (b).\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and\ndisclosure of information.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-2a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c351aeeff2aa4b953d35d0e615e09542aab8412fef1574ea6a15be725573f600",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of CDR-related information to authorized personnel."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-157aa-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "157AA(2A) Disclosure of CDR-related information by Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 556,
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) the Secretary of the Department; or\n\n(b) any employee of the Department or consultant assisting the\nSecretary in performing the Secretary’s functions, or\nexercising the Secretary’s powers, relating to Part IVD;\nany information that the Commission obtains under this Act, or the\nconsumer data rules, that is relevant or likely to be relevant to the\nfunctions or powers referred to in paragraph (b).\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and\ndisclosure of information."
    },
