    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "157AA(3) Disclosure of CDR-related information by Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-157aa-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.556",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) an agency having the function in a foreign country of\nsupervising or regulating the disclosure of similar\ninformation to that covered by an instrument designating a\nsector under subsection 56AC(2); or\n\n(aa) an agency having the function in a foreign country of\nsupervising or regulating types of actions similar to those\ndeclared under section 56ACA; or\n\n(b) an agency, that is prescribed by the regulations, of a foreign\ncountry;\nany information that the Commission obtains:\n\n(c) under this Act in relation to Part IVD or the consumer data\nrules; or\n\n(d) under the consumer data rules.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) an agency having the function in a foreign country of\nsupervising or regulating the disclosure of similar\ninformation to that covered by an instrument designating a\nsector under subsection 56AC(2); or\n\n(aa) an agency having the function in a foreign country of\nsupervising or regulating types of actions similar to those\ndeclared under section 56ACA; or\n\n(b) an agency, that is prescribed by the regulations, of a foreign\ncountry;\nany information that the Commission obtains:\n\n(c) under this Act in relation to Part IVD or the consumer data\nrules; or\n\n(d) under the consumer data rules.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "73f5dcd1c5f11ea23dd9133306ec38ce7015087c14a87de62e7f89ef1f79a8ae",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of CDR-related information to certain agencies"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-157aa-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "157AA(3) Disclosure of CDR-related information by Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 556,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:\n\n(a) an agency having the function in a foreign country of\nsupervising or regulating the disclosure of similar\ninformation to that covered by an instrument designating a\nsector under subsection 56AC(2); or\n\n(aa) an agency having the function in a foreign country of\nsupervising or regulating types of actions similar to those\ndeclared under section 56ACA; or\n\n(b) an agency, that is prescribed by the regulations, of a foreign\ncountry;\nany information that the Commission obtains:\n\n(c) under this Act in relation to Part IVD or the consumer data\nrules; or\n\n(d) under the consumer data rules.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
