        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.561",
      "values:originalText": "proceedings etc.\nCommission or Commission official not required to make discovery\nof documents containing protected cartel information etc.\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) a person is a party to proceedings before a court; and\n\n(b) the Commission is not a party to the proceedings;\nthe Commission or a Commission official is not to be required, in\nconnection with the proceedings, to:\n\n(c) make discovery (however described) to the person of a\ndocument containing protected cartel information; or\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "proceedings etc.\nCommission or Commission official not required to make discovery\nof documents containing protected cartel information etc.\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) a person is a party to proceedings before a court; and\n\n(b) the Commission is not a party to the proceedings;\nthe Commission or a Commission official is not to be required, in\nconnection with the proceedings, to:\n\n(c) make discovery (however described) to the person of a\ndocument containing protected cartel information; or\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d31f2feb469e5292afda54b7bbbf9b7a06bb725ddfee743d8ee3c9be42b7de92",
      "skos:note": "Commission or Commission official not required to disclose protected cartel information in court proceedings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-157c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "157C Disclosure of protected cartel information to a party to court",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 561,
      "values:originalText": "proceedings etc.\nCommission or Commission official not required to make discovery\nof documents containing protected cartel information etc.\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) a person is a party to proceedings before a court; and\n\n(b) the Commission is not a party to the proceedings;\nthe Commission or a Commission official is not to be required, in\nconnection with the proceedings, to:\n\n(c) make discovery (however described) to the person of a\ndocument containing protected cartel information; or\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
