      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.565",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The members of the Commission, the inquiry Chair or the\nCommission (as applicable) may decide to hold the proceedings:\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The members of the Commission, the inquiry Chair or the\nCommission (as applicable) may decide to hold the proceedings:\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "values:partOf": {
