      "skos:note": "Members of Commission may decide to hold proceedings without initiation notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-158a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "158A(2) Proceedings without initiation notice—use of virtual enquiry",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 565,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The members of the Commission, the inquiry Chair or the\nCommission (as applicable) may decide to hold the proceedings:\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-158a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
