    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-159",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "159 Incriminating answers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-159"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.568",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person appearing before the Commission to give evidence or\nproduce documents is not excused from answering a question, or\nproducing a document, on the ground that the answer to the\nquestion, or the document, may tend to incriminate the person or\nexpose the person to a penalty.\n\n(2) Evidence given by an individual before the Commission is not\nadmissible against the individual in any criminal proceedings,\nother than:\n\n(a) proceedings for an offence against this Part; or\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nMiscellaneous  Part XII\n\nSection 160\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) proceedings for an offence against section 137.1, 137.2 or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person appearing before the Commission to give evidence or\nproduce documents is not excused from answering a question, or\nproducing a document, on the ground that the answer to the\nquestion, or the document, may tend to incriminate the person or\nexpose the person to a penalty.\n\n(2) Evidence given by an individual before the Commission is not\nadmissible against the individual in any criminal proceedings,\nother than:\n\n(a) proceedings for an offence against this Part; or\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nMiscellaneous  Part XII\n\nSection 160\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) proceedings for an offence against section 137.1, 137.2 or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
