    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-161",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "161 Refusal to be sworn or to answer questions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-161"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.569",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person appearing as a witness before the Tribunal shall not:\n\n(a) refuse or fail to be sworn or to make an affirmation;\n\n(b) refuse or fail to answer a question that he or she is required to\nanswer by the member presiding at the proceedings; or\n\n(c) refuse or fail to produce a document that he or she was\nrequired to produce by a summons under this Act served on\nhim or her as prescribed.\n\n(1A) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person appearing as a witness before the Tribunal shall not:\n\n(a) refuse or fail to be sworn or to make an affirmation;\n\n(b) refuse or fail to answer a question that he or she is required to\nanswer by the member presiding at the proceedings; or\n\n(c) refuse or fail to produce a document that he or she was\nrequired to produce by a summons under this Act served on\nhim or her as prescribed.\n\n(1A) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person has a reasonable\nexcuse.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-161-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-161-ss-1a"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "871c27f8c731f195432d372d25403bbb55fe2aca6600b5942d4cdf7ddc1510e0"
    },
    {
