      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commission may institute a proceeding in the Court seeking,\nin relation to a matter arising under this Act, a gas market\ninstrument or the consumer data rules, the making of a declaration\nof the kind that may be made under paragraph (1)(a).\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
