      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.576",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A copy of a determination of the Commission, certified to be a true\ncopy by a person authorised by the Commission to certify copies of\ndeterminations of the Commission, shall be received in all courts\nas evidence of the determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A copy of a determination of the Commission, certified to be a true\ncopy by a person authorised by the Commission to certify copies of\ndeterminations of the Commission, shall be received in all courts\nas evidence of the determination.",
