    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-170",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "170 Legal and financial assistance",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-170"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.578",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person:\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nMiscellaneous  Part XII\n\nSection 170\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) who has instituted, or proposes to institute, a proceeding\nbefore the Commission or the Tribunal, or a proceeding\nbefore the Court under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or\nunder Part 3-5 or Chapter 5 of the Australian Consumer Law;\n\n(b) who is entitled to participate, or has been permitted to\nintervene, in a proceeding before the Commission or the\nTribunal; or\n\n(c) against whom a proceeding before the Court has been\ninstituted under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or under",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person:\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 8\nMiscellaneous  Part XII\n\nSection 170\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) who has instituted, or proposes to institute, a proceeding\nbefore the Commission or the Tribunal, or a proceeding\nbefore the Court under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or\nunder Part 3-5 or Chapter 5 of the Australian Consumer Law;\n\n(b) who is entitled to participate, or has been permitted to\nintervene, in a proceeding before the Commission or the\nTribunal; or\n\n(c) against whom a proceeding before the Court has been\ninstituted under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or under",
