      "skos:note": "Regulations do not apply in relation to the functions of the Tribunal under a State/Territory energy law or a designated Commonwealth energy law.",
      "dc:references": [
        "sec-44ZZR"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-172-ss-1b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "172(1B) Regulations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 583,
      "values:originalText": "(1B) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a) or (b) do not\napply in relation to the functions of the Tribunal under a\nState/Territory energy law or a designated Commonwealth energy\nlaw.\nNote:\nSee section 44ZZR."
    },
