      "values:originalText": "The amendments of section 50 made by Schedule 1 to the\nCompetition and Consumer Legislation Amendment Act 2011\napply to acquisitions occurring after the commencement of that\nSchedule.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of section 50 made by Schedule 1 to the\nCompetition and Consumer Legislation Amendment Act 2011\napply to acquisitions occurring after the commencement of that\nSchedule.\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
