    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-185-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "185(3) Merger clearances and authorisations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-185-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.593",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite the repeal of Subdivisions A and C of Division 3 of\nPart VII by Schedule 9 to the amending Act, those Subdivisions\n(other than sections 95AZ, 95AZA, 95AZL and 95AZM) continue\nto apply at and after the commencement time, as if the repeal had\nnot happened, in relation to an application:\n\n(a) made under section 95AU before the commencement time;\nand\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Despite the repeal of Subdivisions A and C of Division 3 of\nPart VII by Schedule 9 to the amending Act, those Subdivisions\n(other than sections 95AZ, 95AZA, 95AZL and 95AZM) continue\nto apply at and after the commencement time, as if the repeal had\nnot happened, in relation to an application:\n\n(a) made under section 95AU before the commencement time;\nand\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-185"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-185-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-185-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5e5aae44445c1d75907dbed18c4a18b8ae22caf02338de8e053f9eb03a6aca71",
      "skos:note": "Continue applying despite repeal"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-185-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "185(3) Merger clearances and authorisations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 593,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite the repeal of Subdivisions A and C of Division 3 of\nPart VII by Schedule 9 to the amending Act, those Subdivisions\n(other than sections 95AZ, 95AZA, 95AZL and 95AZM) continue\nto apply at and after the commencement time, as if the repeal had\nnot happened, in relation to an application:\n\n(a) made under section 95AU before the commencement time;\nand\n\nChapter 8  Miscellaneous"
    },
