      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.600",
      "values:originalText": "Paragraph 171(3)(ab) applies in relation to an annual report for a\nperiod ending on or after 30 June 2026.",
      "skos:definition": "Paragraph 171(3)(ab) applies in relation to an annual report for a\nperiod ending on or after 30 June 2026.",
      "cml:asserts": [
