    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-192-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "192(1) Acquisition of property",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 600,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the Treasury Laws\nAmendment (Mergers and Acquisitions Reform) Act 2024 do not\napply in relation to an acquisition if:\n\n(a) apart from this section, the operation of the amendments in\nrelation to the acquisition would result in an acquisition of\nproperty from a person otherwise than on just terms; and\n\n(b) the acquisition of property would be invalid because of\nparagraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution."
