      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by item 5 of Schedule 1 to the Treasury\nLaws Amendment (Doubling Penalties for ACCC Enforcement) Act\n2026 apply in relation to offences committed on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by item 5 of Schedule 1 to the Treasury\nLaws Amendment (Doubling Penalties for ACCC Enforcement) Act\n2026 apply in relation to offences committed on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.",
